window.VICE_FIELD_NOTES={"en":{"watchTitle":"Beyond the flying saucers","watchIntro":"A watchlist of clues, old development references and Florida folklore. No GTA VI cryptid encounter or exact spawn is confirmed here.","scenery":"Official Leonida scenery — not a creature sighting","leak":"Reported development reference","theory":"Community theory","myths":[["Skunk Ape","Florida’s swamp-ape legend appears in reporting on the 2022 development material. That is a lead, not proof of a finished encounter in Grassrivers."],["Forest Figure","An early event name suggests a woodland mystery. Identifying it as Slender Man, or assigning it to Mount Kalaga, goes beyond the evidence."],["Farm Monster Man","Community transcripts list visits, chemicals and a transformation. These old working labels do not establish a final creature, mission or location."],["Sea creatures, ghosts and vampires","These remain fan theories for GTA VI. A storm-drain voice or a haunted-warehouse label does not confirm a sewer monster or a vampire."],["Bermuda Triangle & Space Coast","Florida’s geography inspires theories, but vanishing aircraft, alien technology and stealable spacecraft have no verified gameplay basis here."]],"legacyTitle":"Rockstar’s wider mystery tradition","legacy":"GTA V’s craft and Red Dead Redemption 2’s sightings at Hani’s Bethel and Mount Shann explain the excitement. They do not establish what GTA VI will contain.","wildlifeTitle":"Read the wild","wildlifeSummary":"Study animals, understand rarity and separate paid hunting from fishing.","wildlifeType":"Wildlife & exploration","wildlifeSections":[["Start with the habitat","Mount Kalaga is presented as hunting and fishing country. Grassrivers is wetland habitat; the Keys open onto marine life. Explore the region first—these are broad areas, not verified rare-animal spawns."],["Rare, Discoverable, Legendary","Developer coverage describes more than 170 species, including over 60 birds and over 30 land mammals. Certain animals fall into these three categories; the Legendary identities remain undisclosed."],["Observe before you act","Studying animals records discoveries in a checklist, including during zoo visits. A complete bestiary, unlock rewards and exact observation requirements are still to be checked in the released game."],["Hunting pays; fishing is different","Hunting is introduced through someone who knows Jason and can earn money. Fishing is described as catch-and-release for enjoyment and challenges; plan no fish-selling route."],["A living ecosystem","The revealed roster includes alligators, flamingos, manatees, pelicans, green iguanas, cane toads and rhesus macaques. Wildlife coverage describes food chains, coat variations, wet fur and light-reactive marine creatures."],["Legendary does not mean supernatural","Rare wildlife and cryptid rumors are separate subjects. The Skunk Ape, Forest Figure and other mysteries stay in X-Files until their final-game presence can be established."]],"readWild":"Wildlife field notes","readMyst":"Follow the mystery watch","calNote":"His official biography identifies Coast Guard communications, not alien transmissions. An extraterrestrial connection is a fan interpretation, not an announced mission."},"es":{"watchTitle":"Más allá de los platillos volantes","watchIntro":"Pistas, referencias antiguas de desarrollo y folclore de Florida. Aquí no se confirma ningún encuentro con críptidos ni un punto exacto de aparición en GTA VI.","scenery":"Paisaje oficial de Leonida; no es un avistamiento","leak":"Referencia de desarrollo documentada","theory":"Teoría de la comunidad","myths":[["Skunk Ape","La leyenda del simio de los pantanos aparece en la cobertura del material de desarrollo de 2022. Es una pista, no la prueba de un encuentro terminado en Grassrivers."],["Forest Figure","Un nombre de evento antiguo apunta a un misterio forestal. Identificarlo con Slender Man o situarlo en Mount Kalaga va más allá de las pruebas."],["Farm Monster Man","Las transcripciones comunitarias mencionan visitas, sustancias químicas y una transformación. Esas etiquetas de trabajo no confirman una criatura, misión o ubicación definitiva."],["Criaturas marinas, fantasmas y vampiros","Siguen siendo teorías para GTA VI. Una voz en un desagüe o un almacén encantado no confirman monstruos de alcantarilla ni vampiros."],["Triángulo de las Bermudas y costa espacial","La geografía de Florida inspira teorías; no hay pruebas verificadas aquí de aeronaves que desaparezcan, tecnología alienígena o naves espaciales robables."]],"legacyTitle":"La tradición de misterios de Rockstar","legacy":"Los ovnis de GTA V y los avistamientos de Red Dead Redemption 2 en Hani’s Bethel y Mount Shann explican el entusiasmo, pero no establecen qué incluirá GTA VI.","wildlifeTitle":"Descubre la vida salvaje","wildlifeSummary":"Estudia animales, entiende su rareza y distingue la caza remunerada de la pesca.","wildlifeType":"Fauna y exploración","wildlifeSections":[["Empieza por el hábitat","Mount Kalaga se presenta como zona de caza y pesca. Grassrivers ofrece humedales y los Cayos, vida marina. Son regiones para explorar, no puntos verificados de animales raros."],["Raros, descubribles y legendarios","La cobertura de los desarrolladores describe más de 170 especies, entre ellas más de 60 aves y 30 mamíferos terrestres. Algunos animales pertenecen a estas categorías; los legendarios siguen sin revelarse."],["Observa antes de actuar","Estudiar animales registra descubrimientos en una lista, incluso en visitas al zoológico. El bestiario completo, las recompensas y los requisitos precisos se comprobarán tras el lanzamiento."],["La caza paga; la pesca es distinta","Un conocido de Jason introduce la caza remunerada. La pesca se describe como captura y suelta, para divertirse y superar desafíos; no planifiques vender peces."],["Un ecosistema vivo","Se han mostrado o descrito caimanes, flamencos, manatíes, pelícanos, iguanas verdes, sapos de caña y macacos rhesus. La cobertura incluye cadenas alimentarias, pelajes variados, pelo mojado y efectos de luz marinos."],["Legendario no significa sobrenatural","La fauna rara y los rumores sobre críptidos son temas distintos. Skunk Ape, Forest Figure y otros misterios permanecen en X-Files hasta comprobar su presencia final."]],"readWild":"Guía de fauna","readMyst":"Sigue las pistas de X-Files","calNote":"Su biografía oficial habla de comunicaciones de la Guardia Costera, no de transmisiones alienígenas. La conexión extraterrestre es una interpretación de los fans, no una misión anunciada."},"pt-br":{"watchTitle":"Além dos discos voadores","watchIntro":"Pistas, antigas referências de desenvolvimento e folclore da Flórida. Nenhum encontro com críptidos ou ponto exato de aparição em GTA VI está confirmado aqui.","scenery":"Cenário oficial de Leonida — não é um avistamento","leak":"Referência de desenvolvimento relatada","theory":"Teoria da comunidade","myths":[["Skunk Ape","A lenda do macaco dos pântanos aparece na cobertura do material de desenvolvimento de 2022. É uma pista, não prova de um encontro final em Grassrivers."],["Forest Figure","Um antigo nome de evento sugere um mistério na floresta. Identificá-lo como Slender Man ou situá-lo em Mount Kalaga vai além das evidências."],["Farm Monster Man","Transcrições comunitárias citam visitas, produtos químicos e uma transformação. Esses nomes de trabalho não confirmam criatura, missão ou localização final."],["Criaturas marinhas, fantasmas e vampiros","Ainda são teorias para GTA VI. Uma voz no bueiro ou um armazém assombrado não confirmam monstros de esgoto ou vampiros."],["Triângulo das Bermudas e costa espacial","A geografia da Flórida inspira teorias; não há comprovação aqui de aeronaves desaparecendo, tecnologia alienígena ou espaçonaves que possam ser roubadas."]],"legacyTitle":"A tradição de mistérios da Rockstar","legacy":"Os discos de GTA V e os avistamentos de Red Dead Redemption 2 em Hani’s Bethel e Mount Shann explicam o entusiasmo, mas não confirmam o conteúdo de GTA VI.","wildlifeTitle":"Conheça a vida selvagem","wildlifeSummary":"Estude animais, entenda a raridade e separe caça remunerada de pesca.","wildlifeType":"Fauna e exploração","wildlifeSections":[["Comece pelo habitat","Mount Kalaga é apresentado como área de caça e pesca. Grassrivers tem pântanos; as Keys, vida marinha. São regiões para explorar, não pontos verificados de animais raros."],["Raros, descobríveis e lendários","A cobertura com os desenvolvedores descreve mais de 170 espécies, incluindo mais de 60 aves e 30 mamíferos terrestres. Certos animais entram nessas categorias; os lendários ainda não foram revelados."],["Observe antes de agir","Estudar animais registra descobertas numa lista, inclusive em visitas ao zoológico. O bestiário completo, as recompensas e os requisitos exatos serão conferidos no jogo lançado."],["Caçar dá dinheiro; pescar é diferente","Um conhecido de Jason apresenta a caça remunerada. A pesca é de captura e soltura, voltada à diversão e aos desafios; não planeje vender peixes."],["Um ecossistema vivo","A fauna divulgada inclui jacarés, flamingos, peixes-boi, pelicanos, iguanas-verdes, sapos-cururu e macacos-rhesus. A cobertura descreve cadeias alimentares, variações de pelagem, pelos molhados e efeitos de luz marinhos."],["Lendário não significa sobrenatural","Animais raros e rumores sobre críptidos são assuntos distintos. Skunk Ape, Forest Figure e outros mistérios ficam nos X-Files até sua presença final ser comprovada."]],"readWild":"Guia da vida selvagem","readMyst":"Acompanhe os mistérios","calNote":"A biografia oficial cita comunicações da Guarda Costeira, não transmissões alienígenas. A conexão extraterrestre é uma interpretação dos fãs, não uma missão anunciada."},"de":{"watchTitle":"Mehr als fliegende Untertassen","watchIntro":"Hinweise, alte Entwicklungsreferenzen und Floridas Folklore. Keine Kryptidenbegegnung oder genaue Fundstelle in GTA VI ist hier bestätigt.","scenery":"Offizielle Leonida-Landschaft — keine Kreaturensichtung","leak":"Berichtete Entwicklungsreferenz","theory":"Fan-Theorie","myths":[["Skunk Ape","Floridas Sumpfaffen-Legende taucht in Berichten zum Entwicklungsmaterial von 2022 auf. Das ist ein Hinweis, kein Beleg für eine fertige Begegnung in Grassrivers."],["Forest Figure","Ein alter Ereignisname deutet auf ein Waldmysterium hin. Slender Man oder Mount Kalaga daraus abzuleiten, geht über die Belege hinaus."],["Farm Monster Man","Community-Transkripte nennen Besuche, Chemikalien und eine Verwandlung. Diese Arbeitsnamen bestätigen weder eine fertige Kreatur noch Mission oder Fundort."],["Seeungeheuer, Geister und Vampire","Für GTA VI bleiben das Fan-Theorien. Eine Stimme im Abfluss oder ein Spuklagerhaus belegen kein Kanalmonster und keinen Vampir."],["Bermudadreieck und Space Coast","Floridas Geografie regt Spekulationen an. Für verschwindende Flugzeuge, Alien-Technik oder stehlbare Raumschiffe gibt es hier keine gesicherte Spielgrundlage."]],"legacyTitle":"Rockstars größere Mysterientradition","legacy":"Die UFOs aus GTA V und die Sichtungen in Red Dead Redemption 2 bei Hani’s Bethel und Mount Shann erklären die Begeisterung. Sie belegen keinen Inhalt für GTA VI.","wildlifeTitle":"Die Wildnis verstehen","wildlifeSummary":"Tiere studieren, Seltenheit verstehen und Jagdverdienst vom Angeln unterscheiden.","wildlifeType":"Tierwelt und Erkundung","wildlifeSections":[["Mit dem Lebensraum beginnen","Mount Kalaga wird als Jagd- und Angelgebiet vorgestellt. Grassrivers bietet Feuchtgebiete, die Keys Meeresleben. Das sind Erkundungsregionen, keine bestätigten Fundpunkte seltener Tiere."],["Rare, Discoverable, Legendary","Entwicklerberichte beschreiben über 170 Arten, darunter über 60 Vogelarten und 30 Landsäugetiere. Bestimmte Tiere gehören zu diesen Kategorien; die legendären Arten bleiben geheim."],["Erst beobachten","Das Studieren von Tieren hält Entdeckungen in einer Checkliste fest, auch im Zoo. Vollständiges Bestiarium, Belohnungen und genaue Anforderungen werden nach Veröffentlichung geprüft."],["Jagen bringt Geld; Angeln funktioniert anders","Ein Bekannter von Jason führt die bezahlte Jagd ein. Beim Angeln werden die Fische wieder freigelassen; es dient Spaß und Herausforderungen. Plane keinen Fischverkauf."],["Ein lebendiges Ökosystem","Gezeigt oder beschrieben wurden Alligatoren, Flamingos, Seekühe, Pelikane, grüne Leguane, Aga-Kröten und Rhesusaffen. Die Berichte nennen Nahrungsketten, Fellvarianten, nasses Fell und Lichteffekte bei Meerestieren."],["Legendär heißt nicht übernatürlich","Seltene Tiere und Kryptidengerüchte sind verschiedene Themen. Skunk Ape, Forest Figure und weitere Rätsel bleiben in den X-Files, bis ihre endgültige Präsenz belegt ist."]],"readWild":"Tierwelt erkunden","readMyst":"Den Mysterien folgen","calNote":"Seine offizielle Biografie nennt Funkverkehr der Küstenwache, keine Alien-Signale. Ein außerirdischer Bezug ist eine Fan-Deutung, keine angekündigte Mission."},"fr":{"watchTitle":"Au-delà des soucoupes volantes","watchIntro":"Indices, anciennes références de développement et folklore floridien. Aucune rencontre avec un cryptide ni position précise dans GTA VI n’est confirmée ici.","scenery":"Paysage officiel de Leonida — aucune créature observée","leak":"Référence de développement rapportée","theory":"Théorie de fans","myths":[["Skunk Ape","La légende du singe des marais figure dans les articles sur les données de développement de 2022. Une piste, pas la preuve d’une rencontre finale à Grassrivers."],["Forest Figure","Un ancien nom d’événement évoque un mystère forestier. Y voir Slender Man ou le situer à Mount Kalaga dépasse les éléments disponibles."],["Farm Monster Man","Les transcriptions communautaires mentionnent des visites, des produits chimiques et une transformation. Ces noms de travail ne confirment ni créature, ni mission, ni lieu définitif."],["Monstres marins, fantômes et vampires","Ce sont encore des théories pour GTA VI. Une voix dans un égout ou un entrepôt hanté ne prouvent pas la présence d’un monstre ou d’un vampire."],["Triangle des Bermudes et côte spatiale","La géographie floridienne inspire les fans, mais avions disparus, technologie extraterrestre et vaisseaux dérobables n’ont ici aucune base de gameplay vérifiée."]],"legacyTitle":"La tradition des mystères chez Rockstar","legacy":"Les ovnis de GTA V et les apparitions de Red Dead Redemption 2 à Hani’s Bethel et Mount Shann expliquent l’enthousiasme. Ils ne confirment rien pour GTA VI.","wildlifeTitle":"Comprendre la vie sauvage","wildlifeSummary":"Étudiez les animaux, leur rareté et la différence entre chasse rémunérée et pêche.","wildlifeType":"Faune et exploration","wildlifeSections":[["Commencez par le milieu","Mount Kalaga est présenté comme un territoire de chasse et de pêche. Grassrivers abrite des marais, les Keys de la vie marine. Ce sont des régions à explorer, pas des apparitions rares vérifiées."],["Rares, à découvrir et légendaires","Les reportages auprès des développeurs décrivent plus de 170 espèces, dont plus de 60 oiseaux et 30 mammifères terrestres. Certains animaux relèvent de ces catégories ; les légendaires restent secrets."],["Observez avant d’agir","Étudier les animaux enregistre les découvertes dans une liste, y compris au zoo. Le bestiaire complet, les récompenses et les conditions exactes seront vérifiés à la sortie."],["La chasse rapporte ; la pêche est différente","Une connaissance de Jason introduit la chasse rémunérée. La pêche consiste à relâcher les prises, pour le plaisir et les défis ; ne prévoyez pas de vendre les poissons."],["Un écosystème vivant","La faune présentée comprend alligators, flamants, lamantins, pélicans, iguanes verts, crapauds buffles et macaques rhésus. La couverture décrit chaînes alimentaires, variations de pelage, fourrure mouillée et effets lumineux marins."],["Légendaire ne veut pas dire surnaturel","Les animaux rares et les rumeurs de cryptides restent distincts. Skunk Ape, Forest Figure et les autres mystères restent dans X-Files en attendant leur présence vérifiable."]],"readWild":"Guide de la faune","readMyst":"Suivre les mystères","calNote":"Sa biographie officielle parle de communications des garde-côtes, pas de transmissions extraterrestres. Le lien avec les aliens reste une interprétation des fans, pas une mission annoncée."},"it":{"watchTitle":"Oltre i dischi volanti","watchIntro":"Indizi, vecchi riferimenti di sviluppo e folclore della Florida. Qui non sono confermati incontri con criptidi né punti esatti di comparsa in GTA VI.","scenery":"Paesaggio ufficiale di Leonida — non un avvistamento","leak":"Riferimento di sviluppo riportato","theory":"Teoria dei fan","myths":[["Skunk Ape","La leggenda della scimmia delle paludi compare nei resoconti sul materiale di sviluppo del 2022. È un indizio, non la prova di un incontro definitivo a Grassrivers."],["Forest Figure","Un vecchio nome di evento suggerisce un mistero nei boschi. Identificarlo con Slender Man o collocarlo a Mount Kalaga supera le prove disponibili."],["Farm Monster Man","Le trascrizioni della comunità citano visite, sostanze chimiche e una trasformazione. Questi nomi di lavoro non confermano creatura, missione o luogo finale."],["Mostri marini, fantasmi e vampiri","Restano teorie per GTA VI. Una voce nello scarico o un magazzino infestato non confermano mostri nelle fogne o vampiri."],["Triangolo delle Bermuda e costa spaziale","La geografia della Florida ispira teorie, ma aerei scomparsi, tecnologia aliena e astronavi rubabili non hanno qui riscontri di gioco verificati."]],"legacyTitle":"La tradizione dei misteri Rockstar","legacy":"Gli UFO di GTA V e gli avvistamenti di Red Dead Redemption 2 a Hani’s Bethel e Mount Shann spiegano l’entusiasmo. Non confermano contenuti per GTA VI.","wildlifeTitle":"Conosci la natura selvaggia","wildlifeSummary":"Studia gli animali, la loro rarità e la differenza tra caccia remunerata e pesca.","wildlifeType":"Fauna ed esplorazione","wildlifeSections":[["Parti dall’habitat","Mount Kalaga è presentato come territorio di caccia e pesca. Grassrivers offre zone umide, le Keys vita marina. Sono regioni da esplorare, non punti verificati di animali rari."],["Rari, da scoprire e leggendari","I resoconti degli sviluppatori descrivono oltre 170 specie, con più di 60 uccelli e 30 mammiferi terrestri. Alcuni animali rientrano in queste categorie; i leggendari restano segreti."],["Osserva prima di agire","Studiare gli animali registra le scoperte in un elenco, anche allo zoo. Bestiario completo, premi e requisiti precisi saranno verificati dopo l’uscita."],["La caccia paga; la pesca è diversa","Un conoscente di Jason introduce la caccia remunerata. La pesca prevede il rilascio delle catture, per divertimento e sfide: non pianificare di vendere pesci."],["Un ecosistema vivo","La fauna presentata include alligatori, fenicotteri, lamantini, pellicani, iguane verdi, rospi delle canne e macachi rhesus. La copertura descrive catene alimentari, pellicce variabili, pelo bagnato ed effetti luminosi marini."],["Leggendario non significa soprannaturale","Animali rari e voci sui criptidi sono temi distinti. Skunk Ape, Forest Figure e altri misteri restano negli X-Files finché la loro presenza finale non sarà verificata."]],"readWild":"Guida alla fauna","readMyst":"Segui i misteri","calNote":"La biografia ufficiale cita comunicazioni della Guardia Costiera, non trasmissioni aliene. Il legame extraterrestre è un’interpretazione dei fan, non una missione annunciata."},"ru":{"watchTitle":"Не только летающие тарелки","watchIntro":"Зацепки, старые рабочие названия и фольклор Флориды. Здесь не подтверждены ни встречи с криптидами в GTA VI, ни точные места их появления.","scenery":"Официальный пейзаж Леониды — не снимок существа","leak":"Упоминание в материалах разработки","theory":"Теория сообщества","myths":[["Skunk Ape","Легенда о болотной обезьяне фигурирует в сообщениях о материалах разработки 2022 года. Это зацепка, а не доказательство готовой встречи в Грассриверс."],["Forest Figure","Старое название события намекает на лесную загадку. Называть её Слендерменом или помещать на гору Калага пока нет оснований."],["Farm Monster Man","В транскриптах сообщества перечислены визиты, химикаты и превращение. Эти рабочие названия не подтверждают существо, миссию или место в готовой игре."],["Морские чудовища, призраки и вампиры","Для GTA VI это пока фанатские теории. Голос из стока или склад с привидениями не доказывают наличие канализационного монстра либо вампира."],["Бермудский треугольник и космическое побережье","География Флориды вдохновляет теории, но исчезающие самолёты, инопланетная техника и угоняемые космические корабли здесь не подтверждены."]],"legacyTitle":"Традиция тайн в играх Rockstar","legacy":"НЛО в GTA V и наблюдения у Hani’s Bethel и Mount Shann в Red Dead Redemption 2 объясняют интерес. Они не подтверждают содержимое GTA VI.","wildlifeTitle":"Изучайте дикую природу","wildlifeSummary":"Наблюдайте за животными, разбирайтесь в редкости и отличайте заработок на охоте от рыбалки.","wildlifeType":"Животные и исследование","wildlifeSections":[["Начните со среды обитания","Гора Калага представлена как район охоты и рыбалки. Грассриверс — болота, острова — морская жизнь. Это области для исследования, а не проверенные точки появления редких животных."],["Редкие, открываемые и легендарные","Материалы с разработчиками описывают свыше 170 видов, включая более 60 птиц и 30 наземных млекопитающих. Некоторые животные относятся к этим категориям; легендарные виды пока не названы."],["Сначала наблюдайте","Изучение животных отмечает открытия в списке, в том числе в зоопарке. Полный бестиарий, награды и точные условия проверим после выхода игры."],["Охота приносит доход; рыбалка устроена иначе","Знакомый Джейсона вводит оплачиваемую охоту. Пойманную рыбу отпускают; рыбалка служит развлечением и испытанием. Не планируйте заработок на продаже рыбы."],["Живая экосистема","Среди показанных или описанных животных — аллигаторы, фламинго, ламантины, пеликаны, зелёные игуаны, жабы-аги и макаки-резусы. Описаны пищевые цепочки, варианты окраса, мокрый мех и световые эффекты морских существ."],["Легендарный не значит сверхъестественный","Редкая фауна и слухи о криптидах — разные темы. Skunk Ape, Forest Figure и другие загадки остаются в X-Files до подтверждения в готовой игре."]],"readWild":"Путеводитель по фауне","readMyst":"Следить за загадками","calNote":"Официальная биография говорит о связи береговой охраны, а не об инопланетных сигналах. Связь с пришельцами — фанатская трактовка, не анонсированная миссия."}};
window.VICE_ACTIVITY_NOTES={"en":["Between the big jobs","Sports, water, wheels and nights out—choose a break that suits your next move.","Activities & downtime",[["Train or play","Gyms, basketball, pool and mini-golf are covered in the revealed activity lineup. Use the fitness guide for training; do not assume every sport grants the same stat boost."],["Take to the water","Kayaking, airboating, jet skiing, scuba diving and snorkeling broaden the ways to explore. Cave diving has been shown too; exact equipment requirements and access points await release."],["Chase a different thrill","Street, off-road and sea races sit alongside parachuting and base jumping. Vehicle choice matters to the setting, but entry fees, courses and rewards are not yet a verified route guide."],["Practice and watch","Shooting ranges and backyard wrestling appear in coverage. The footage does not establish every rule, a wrestling league, or that every visible object becomes usable equipment."],["Stay out after dark","Nightclubs, dancing, drinking, strip clubs, amusement parks, sunbathing and television appear across the activity coverage. Treat these as leisure options, not automatic sources of cash."],["Make time together","Shared outings, wildlife study and some crimes can bring Jason and Lucia together. Not every activity has been established as a two-person mode; the partnership guide explains the relationship separately."]]],"es":["Entre grandes golpes","Deporte, agua, motor y noches fuera: elige una pausa para tu próxima jugada.","Actividades y ocio",[["Entrena o juega","Gimnasios, baloncesto, billar y minigolf figuran entre las actividades mostradas. Consulta la guía de entrenamiento; no todos los deportes tienen por qué mejorar las mismas estadísticas."],["Explora el agua","Kayaks, hidrodeslizadores, motos acuáticas, buceo y esnórquel amplían la exploración. También se han mostrado cuevas submarinas; el equipo y los accesos precisos se comprobarán al salir."],["Busca otra emoción","Carreras callejeras, todoterreno y acuáticas acompañan al paracaidismo y salto BASE. Los vehículos deben encajar con el terreno; cuotas, circuitos y premios aún no forman una ruta verificada."],["Practica y observa","La cobertura muestra campos de tiro y lucha en patios. Eso no establece todas sus reglas, una liga de lucha ni que cada objeto visible sea equipamiento utilizable."],["Disfruta de la noche","Discotecas, baile, bebida, clubes de striptease, parques de atracciones, tomar el sol y ver televisión aparecen en la cobertura. Son opciones de ocio, no ingresos automáticos."],["Haz planes en pareja","Las salidas, observar fauna y algunos delitos pueden reunir a Jason y Lucia. No todas las actividades tienen modo para dos; la guía de pareja explica la relación por separado."]]],"pt-br":["Entre os grandes golpes","Esporte, água, motores e vida noturna: escolha uma pausa para a próxima jogada.","Atividades e lazer",[["Treine ou jogue","Academias, basquete, sinuca e minigolfe estão na lista divulgada. Consulte o guia de treino; não presuma que todo esporte melhora os mesmos atributos."],["Explore a água","Caiaques, aerobarcos, motos aquáticas, mergulho e snorkel ampliam a exploração. Cavernas subaquáticas também foram mostradas; equipamentos e acessos exatos serão conferidos no lançamento."],["Busque outra adrenalina","Corridas de rua, fora de estrada e aquáticas se juntam ao paraquedismo e salto BASE. Escolha o veículo pelo terreno; taxas, percursos e prêmios ainda não têm roteiro verificado."],["Pratique e observe","Estandes de tiro e luta de quintal aparecem na cobertura. As imagens não estabelecem todas as regras, uma liga de luta ou que cada objeto visto seja equipamento utilizável."],["Curta a noite","Boates, dança, bebida, clubes de striptease, parques, banho de sol e televisão aparecem na cobertura. São opções de lazer, não fontes automáticas de dinheiro."],["Reserve tempo para os dois","Passeios, estudo de animais e alguns crimes podem juntar Jason e Lucia. Nem toda atividade tem modo em dupla confirmado; o guia da parceria explica a relação separadamente."]]],"de":["Zwischen den großen Jobs","Sport, Wasser, Motoren und Nachtleben: Wähle eine Pause für deinen nächsten Schritt.","Aktivitäten und Freizeit",[["Trainieren oder spielen","Fitnessstudios, Basketball, Billard und Minigolf gehören zum gezeigten Angebot. Nutze den Trainingsratgeber; nicht jede Sportart verbessert automatisch dieselben Werte."],["Ab aufs Wasser","Kajaks, Sumpfboote, Jetskis, Tauchen und Schnorcheln erweitern die Erkundung. Auch Höhlentauchen wurde gezeigt; genaue Ausrüstung und Zugänge werden nach Veröffentlichung geprüft."],["Andere Abenteuer","Straßen-, Gelände- und Wasserrennen ergänzen Fallschirm- und BASE-Sprünge. Wähle das Fahrzeug zum Gelände; Startgelder, Strecken und Preise sind noch kein verifizierter Routenplan."],["Üben und zuschauen","Schießstände und Hinterhof-Wrestling sind in der Berichterstattung zu sehen. Daraus folgen weder alle Regeln noch eine Wrestling-Liga oder die Nutzbarkeit jedes sichtbaren Gegenstands."],["Nachts unterwegs","Clubs, Tanzen, Trinken, Stripclubs, Freizeitparks, Sonnenbaden und Fernsehen tauchen in der Berichterstattung auf. Das sind Freizeitangebote, keine automatischen Einnahmen."],["Zeit zu zweit","Ausflüge, Tierbeobachtung und manche Verbrechen bringen Jason und Lucia zusammen. Nicht jede Aktivität hat einen bestätigten Zweiermodus; der Partnerschaftsratgeber erklärt die Beziehung getrennt."]]],"fr":["Entre deux gros coups","Sport, eau, moteurs et sorties : choisissez une pause avant votre prochain coup.","Activités et loisirs",[["S’entraîner ou jouer","Salles de sport, basket, billard et minigolf figurent parmi les activités présentées. Consultez le guide sportif ; chaque discipline n’améliore pas forcément les mêmes statistiques."],["Explorer les eaux","Kayak, hydroglisseur, jet-ski, plongée et snorkeling élargissent l’exploration. La plongée souterraine a aussi été montrée ; équipement et accès précis seront vérifiés à la sortie."],["Changer de sensations","Courses de rue, tout-terrain et nautiques complètent parachutisme et BASE jump. Adaptez le véhicule au terrain ; frais, parcours et récompenses restent à vérifier."],["Pratiquer et observer","Stands de tir et catch de jardin apparaissent dans les présentations. Les images n’établissent ni toutes les règles, ni une ligue, ni l’utilisation de chaque objet visible."],["Sortir après la nuit tombée","Clubs, danse, boissons, stripclubs, parcs, bronzage et télévision apparaissent dans la couverture. Ce sont des loisirs, pas des revenus automatiques."],["Passer du temps ensemble","Sorties, étude des animaux et certains délits réunissent Jason et Lucia. Toutes les activités n’ont pas un mode à deux confirmé ; le guide du duo explique la relation séparément."]]],"it":["Tra un colpo e l’altro","Sport, acqua, motori e vita notturna: scegli una pausa per la prossima mossa.","Attività e tempo libero",[["Allenati o gioca","Palestre, basket, biliardo e minigolf figurano tra le attività mostrate. Consulta la guida all’allenamento: non tutti gli sport migliorano automaticamente le stesse statistiche."],["Esplora le acque","Kayak, airboat, moto d’acqua, immersioni e snorkeling ampliano l’esplorazione. Sono state mostrate anche grotte sommerse; attrezzatura e accessi precisi saranno verificati all’uscita."],["Cerca nuove emozioni","Gare stradali, fuoristrada e acquatiche affiancano paracadutismo e BASE jumping. Scegli il veicolo adatto; quote, percorsi e premi non hanno ancora una guida verificata."],["Allenati e osserva","Poligoni e wrestling nei cortili compaiono nella copertura. Le immagini non stabiliscono tutte le regole, una lega o che ogni oggetto visibile sia utilizzabile."],["Vivi la notte","Club, ballo, bevute, strip club, parchi, tintarella e televisione compaiono nella copertura. Sono svaghi, non fonti automatiche di denaro."],["Trova tempo per la coppia","Uscite, studio degli animali e alcuni crimini possono riunire Jason e Lucia. Non ogni attività ha una modalità a due confermata; la guida della coppia spiega la relazione a parte."]]],"ru":["Между большими делами","Спорт, вода, машины и ночная жизнь: выберите отдых перед следующей вылазкой.","Занятия и отдых",[["Тренируйтесь или играйте","В показанных занятиях есть спортзалы, баскетбол, бильярд и мини-гольф. Обратитесь к руководству по тренировкам: не всякий спорт обязательно повышает одинаковые характеристики."],["Исследуйте воду","Каяки, аэролодки, гидроциклы, дайвинг и снорклинг расширяют исследование. Показаны и подводные пещеры; точное снаряжение и входы проверим после релиза."],["Ищите новые ощущения","Уличные, внедорожные и водные гонки дополняют парашютные и BASE-прыжки. Подбирайте транспорт под местность; взносы, трассы и награды ещё предстоит проверить."],["Практикуйтесь и наблюдайте","В материалах фигурируют тиры и дворовый рестлинг. Это не подтверждает все правила, отдельную лигу или возможность использовать каждый видимый предмет."],["Отдыхайте после заката","Клубы, танцы, выпивка, стрип-клубы, парки развлечений, загар и телевизор встречаются в материалах. Это отдых, а не автоматические источники дохода."],["Проводите время вместе","Прогулки, изучение животных и некоторые преступления объединяют Джейсона и Люсию. Режим для двоих подтверждён не для всех занятий; отношения объясняет отдельное руководство."]]]};
window.VICE_NOTE_SOURCES={"wildlife":[{"name":"Game Informer — wildlife developer coverage","url":"https://gameinformer.com/exclusive/2026/09/28/exclusive-grand-theft-auto-vi-includes-over-170-animal-species"},{"name":"Red Bull — wildlife and observation","url":"https://www.redbull.com/us-en/gta-6-wildlife"},{"name":"GameSpot — hunting and catch-and-release","url":"https://tech.yahoo.com/gaming/articles/gta-6-fishing-hunting-doesn-135303566.html"},{"name":"Rockstar — Only in Leonida","url":"https://www.rockstargames.com/VI/only-in-leonida"}],"activities":[{"name":"GTABase — activities and side missions","url":"https://www.gtabase.com/gta-6/side-missions/"},{"name":"SVG — revealed activities","url":"https://www.svg.com/2272709/gta-6-side-activities-confirmed-rockstar/"},{"name":"GamesRadar — activities","url":"https://www.gamesradar.com/games/grand-theft-auto/gta-6-side-activities/"}],"mysteries":[{"name":"GTA.com.ua — reported development event names","url":"https://gta.com.ua/news/gta6/3818"},{"name":"GameSpot — development-era mystery references","url":"https://www.gamespot.com/articles/gta-6-leak-reveals-alligators-sex-robots-airboats-and-skunk-ape-sightings/1100-6507696/"},{"name":"RDR2.org — historical UFO encounters","url":"https://www.rdr2.org/wiki/easter-eggs/4/"}]};

(()=>{'use strict';const e=x=>String(x??'').replace(/[&<>"']/g,c=>({'&':'&amp;','<':'&lt;','>':'&gt;','"':'&quot;',"'":'&#39;'}[c]));const lang=window.VICE_LOCALE||'en',d=window.VICE_FIELD_NOTES[lang]||window.VICE_FIELD_NOTES.en,a=window.VICE_ACTIVITY_NOTES[lang]||window.VICE_ACTIVITY_NOTES.en;
const guides=[{id:'wildlife',name:d.wildlifeTitle,type:d.wildlifeType,summary:d.wildlifeSummary,body:d.wildlifeSections.map(x=>x[1]),sections:d.wildlifeSections.map((x,i)=>({title:x[0],body:x[1],image:'assets/hd/photo-'+[132,134,129,70,66,128][i]+'.webp'})),sources:window.VICE_NOTE_SOURCES.wildlife},{id:'activities',name:a[0],summary:a[1],type:a[2],body:a[3].map(x=>x[1]),sections:a[3].map((x,i)=>({title:x[0],body:x[1],image:'assets/hd/photo-'+[11,133,47,80,108,39][i]+'.webp'})),sources:window.VICE_NOTE_SOURCES.activities}];for(const g of guides){const i=window.ATLAS.guides.findIndex(x=>x.id===g.id);if(i>=0)window.ATLAS.guides[i]=g;else window.ATLAS.guides.push(g);}
const cal=window.VICE_CHARACTER_PROFILES?.cal;if(cal&&!cal.trivia.includes(d.calNote))cal.trivia.push(d.calNote);
window.ATLAS.ufoSources.push(...window.VICE_NOTE_SOURCES.mysteries);
function watch(){return '<section class="mystery-watch" id="mystery-watch"><header><span class="eyebrow">GTA VI / X-FILES</span><h2>'+e(d.watchTitle)+'</h2><p>'+e(d.watchIntro)+'</p></header><div class="mystery-watch-grid">'+d.myths.map((m,i)=>'<article class="mystery-note reveal-item"><figure><img src="assets/hd/photo-'+[129,134,123,116,113][i]+'.webp" alt="" loading="lazy"><figcaption>'+e(d.scenery)+'</figcaption></figure><div><span class="guide-status">'+e(i<3?d.leak:d.theory)+'</span><h3 class="soft-title">'+e(m[0])+'</h3><p>'+e(m[1])+'</p></div></article>').join('')+'</div><aside class="mystery-legacy"><h3 class="soft-title">'+e(d.legacyTitle)+'</h3><p>'+e(d.legacy)+'</p><a class="button" href="#guides?guide=wildlife">'+e(d.readWild)+' →</a></aside></section>';}
function reader(g){return (g.playLinks?'<div class="field-note-links reader-related">'+g.playLinks.map(x=>'<a class="button" href="'+x.href+'" data-close-dialog>'+e(x.label)+' →</a>').join('')+'</div>':'')+'<nav class="reader-quicklinks">'+g.sections.map((s,i)=>'<button data-reader-jump="note-'+g.id+'-'+i+'">'+e(s.title)+'</button>').join('')+'</nav><div class="field-note-stories">'+g.sections.map((s,i)=>'<article id="note-'+g.id+'-'+i+'" class="field-note-story reader-step">'+(s.image?'<figure><img src="'+e(s.image)+'" alt="" loading="lazy"></figure>':'')+'<div><h3 class="soft-title">'+e(s.title)+'</h3><p>'+e(s.body)+'</p></div></article>').join('')+'</div>'+ (g.id==='wildlife'?'<div class="field-note-links"><a class="button" href="#fieldguide?region=mount-kalaga" data-close-dialog>Mount Kalaga →</a><a class="button" href="#money?method=hunting" data-close-dialog>'+e(window.VICE_MONEY_CONTENT.methods.find(x=>x.id==='hunting').title)+' →</a><a class="text-link" href="#ufos" data-close-dialog>'+e(d.readMyst)+' →</a></div>':g.id==='activities'?'<div class="field-note-links"><button class="button" data-guide-open="progression">'+e(window.ATLAS.guides.find(x=>x.id==='progression').name)+' →</button><button class="button" data-guide-open="relationship-status">'+e(window.ATLAS.guides.find(x=>x.id==='relationship-status').name)+' →</button><a class="button" href="#items?tab=services" data-close-dialog>'+e(window.localizeText('Shops & activities'))+' →</a></div>':'');}
function region(id){return ['grassrivers','mount-kalaga','leonida-keys'].includes(id)?'<div class="region-field-links"><a class="text-link" href="#guides?guide=wildlife">'+e(d.readWild)+' →</a><a class="text-link" href="#ufos">'+e(d.readMyst)+' →</a></div>':'';}
document.addEventListener('click',ev=>{const b=ev.target.closest('[data-reader-jump]');if(b)document.getElementById(b.dataset.readerJump)?.scrollIntoView({behavior:matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce)').matches?'auto':'smooth',block:'start'});});window.ViceFieldNotes={watch,reader,region};})();
window.VICE_GAMEPLAY_COPY={"en":{"police":{"name":"Plan your escape","summary":"Break the pursuit, then deal with the clues you leave behind.","sections":[{"title":"Read the response","body":"The wanted system reaches six stars. Watch witnesses, alarms and trackers; a quiet approach and an exit plan matter before the chase starts.","image":"assets/hd/photo-47.webp"},{"title":"Check what police know","body":"Observed identifiers include your face or physical description, clothing, CCTV evidence, weapon, partner and vehicle. Change what has been identified rather than assuming one disguise erases everything.","image":"assets/hd/photo-56.webp"},{"title":"Look beyond the radar","body":"Police no longer appear as simple minimap icons with vision cones in the reported system. Focus can help highlight danger, but do not rely on it as a complete substitute for watching the street.","image":"assets/hd/photo-41.webp"},{"title":"Leave the hot area","body":"A crime area can retain police attention after you escape. Break sight, consider different transport and check the remaining indicators before returning. No fixed heat timer or universal full-outfit rule is established.","image":"assets/hd/photo-8.webp"}],"sources":[{"name":"IGN — Rob Nelson interview","url":"https://www.bestbuy.com/gamers/gamers-articles/pcmcat1791490206931"},{"name":"Edge — GTA VI cover preview","url":"https://www.gamesradar.com/edge/gtavi-cover/"},{"name":"GamesRadar — six-star wanted system","url":"https://www.gamesradar.com/games/grand-theft-auto/gta-6-wanted-system-goes-up-to-6-stars-and-lets-police-track-your-face-your-clothes-and-your-car/"},{"name":"GamesRadar — police radar and Focus","url":"https://www.gamesradar.com/games/grand-theft-auto/rockstar-boss-says-gta-6s-police-can-be-harder-to-shake-off-than-before-but-its-fun-because-it-forces-you-to-think-more/"}],"body":["The wanted system reaches six stars. Watch witnesses, alarms and trackers; a quiet approach and an exit plan matter before the chase starts.","Observed identifiers include your face or physical description, clothing, CCTV evidence, weapon, partner and vehicle. Change what has been identified rather than assuming one disguise erases everything.","Police no longer appear as simple minimap icons with vision cones in the reported system. Focus can help highlight danger, but do not rely on it as a complete substitute for watching the street.","A crime area can retain police attention after you escape. Break sight, consider different transport and check the remaining indicators before returning. No fixed heat timer or universal full-outfit rule is established."]},"criminal-profile":{"name":"Your criminal reputation","summary":"Keep behavioral reputation separate from police heat and romance.","sections":[{"title":"Two characters, two patterns","body":"Jason and Lucia have independent Criminal Profiles. Repeated unnecessary escalation shapes the kind of criminal each becomes; completing a required mission is not judged like attacking helpless bystanders. Context matters, including who started a confrontation.","image":"assets/hd/photo-47.webp"},{"title":"Read the labels carefully","body":"Earlier previews describe Professional, Aggressive, Violent and Psycho. Edge later describes a span from Professional to Irredeemable. These reports do not establish one final five-step ladder.","image":"assets/hd/photo-12.webp"},{"title":"A consequence worth watching","body":"Preview reporting describes a cracked or shattered state that cannot recover during that playthrough. Its exact threshold—and whether it corresponds to Irredeemable—has not been established. Do not rely on a recovery trick.","image":"assets/hd/photo-56.webp"},{"title":"Choose restraint; keep systems separate","body":"Controlling a situation without unnecessary harm is the practical approach. Changing clothes or removing evidence addresses police identification, not a proven reputation reset. Hiding profile notifications does not turn off tracking.","image":"assets/hd/photo-39.webp"}],"sources":[{"name":"IGN — Rob Nelson interview","url":"https://www.bestbuy.com/gamers/gamers-articles/pcmcat1791490206931"},{"name":"Edge — GTA VI cover preview","url":"https://www.gamesradar.com/edge/gtavi-cover/"},{"name":"PC Gamer — Criminal Profile preview reporting","url":"https://www.pcgamer.com/games/grand-theft-auto/gta-6s-criminal-profile-system-sounds-pretty-interesting-isnt-a-direct-copy-of-red-deads-honor-system/"},{"name":"Famitsu — developer interview","url":"https://www.famitsu.com/article/202608/85753"}],"body":["Jason and Lucia have independent Criminal Profiles. Repeated unnecessary escalation shapes the kind of criminal each becomes; completing a required mission is not judged like attacking helpless bystanders. Context matters, including who started a confrontation.","Earlier previews describe Professional, Aggressive, Violent and Psycho. Edge later describes a span from Professional to Irredeemable. These reports do not establish one final five-step ladder.","Preview reporting describes a cracked or shattered state that cannot recover during that playthrough. Its exact threshold—and whether it corresponds to Irredeemable—has not been established. Do not rely on a recovery trick.","Controlling a situation without unnecessary harm is the practical approach. Changing clothes or removing evidence addresses police identification, not a proven reputation reset. Hiding profile notifications does not turn off tracking."]},"relationship-status":{"name":"Partners, your way","summary":"Romance shapes the relationship; cooperation does not require it.","sections":[{"title":"Decide how close they become","body":"Jason and Lucia remain capable partners in crime even without a close romance. Nurturing the relationship is optional; it is not a compulsory combat upgrade or a condition for reliable cooperation.","image":"assets/hd/photo-39.webp"},{"title":"Make room between jobs","body":"Shared outings, conversations, messages and some crimes together create time for the pair. Beach walks, kayaking, zoo visits and animal study are examples; not every activity has a confirmed two-character mode.","image":"assets/hd/photo-15.webp"},{"title":"Follow the relationship status","body":"Edge describes a four-point closeness scale. Attention and time together matter; ignoring contact can affect closeness. Exact thresholds, decay timers and a universal list of affection rewards remain unannounced.","image":"assets/hd/photo-70.webp"},{"title":"Expect story consequences","body":"Closeness can influence how their story unfolds and the affection they show. Specific endings and permanent-breakup rules are not a verified guide. Each character’s Criminal Profile remains a separate system.","image":"assets/hd/photo-76.webp"}],"sources":[{"name":"IGN — Rob Nelson interview","url":"https://www.bestbuy.com/gamers/gamers-articles/pcmcat1791490206931"},{"name":"Edge — four-point closeness scale","url":"https://www.gamesradar.com/edge/gtavi-cover/"},{"name":"Famitsu — developer interview","url":"https://www.famitsu.com/article/202608/85753"}],"body":["Jason and Lucia remain capable partners in crime even without a close romance. Nurturing the relationship is optional; it is not a compulsory combat upgrade or a condition for reliable cooperation.","Shared outings, conversations, messages and some crimes together create time for the pair. Beach walks, kayaking, zoo visits and animal study are examples; not every activity has a confirmed two-character mode.","Edge describes a four-point closeness scale. Attention and time together matter; ignoring contact can affect closeness. Exact thresholds, decay timers and a universal list of affection rewards remain unannounced.","Closeness can influence how their story unfolds and the affection they show. Specific endings and permanent-breakup rules are not a verified guide. Each character’s Criminal Profile remains a separate system."]},"launch":{"name":"Launch, storage & editions","summary":"Prepare the console, check the edition, and know when bonuses unlock.","sections":[{"title":"Prepare your console","body":"Launch is November 19, 2026 on PS5 and Xbox Series X|S. Digital preload began November 10. Rockstar lists up to 212 GB of preload space depending on device; check your console’s current requirement and leave room for updates.","image":"assets/hd/photo-39.webp"},{"title":"Choose the edition","body":"US list prices are $79.99 Standard and $99.99 Ultimate. The $20 Ultimate upgrade is sold separately. Both editions share the November 19 launch; preloading is preparation, not playable access.","image":"assets/hd/photo-6.webp"},{"title":"Know what you receive","body":"Boxed Standard contains a download code, not a disc; match its region to your account. Ultimate is digital, and its bonus content unlocks across story chapters rather than all arriving immediately.","image":"assets/hd/photo-42.webp"},{"title":"Check the bonus terms","body":"Eligible digital purchases before November 20 include the Vintage Vice City Pack and a month of GTA+. Physical bonus availability is limited by stock. Redeemed GTA+ renews monthly until canceled; review the subscription before claiming it.","image":"assets/hd/photo-104.webp"}],"sources":[{"name":"Rockstar Support — editions and versions","url":"https://support.rockstargames.com/articles/4QfG4FmZCf5W1gS8jy4UVT/grand-theft-auto-vi-platform-editions-and-versions"},{"name":"Rockstar Support — preload FAQ","url":"https://support.rockstargames.com/articles/7nPqOA2uCbpEQHXx7KVrYd/grand-theft-auto-vi-pre-load-faq"},{"name":"Take-Two — US edition prices","url":"https://www.take2games.com/ir/news/rockstar-games-announces-pre-orders-grand-theft-auto-vi"},{"name":"Xbox US — Ultimate Edition Upgrade","url":"https://www.xbox.com/en-us/games/store/grand-theft-auto-vi-ultimate-edition-upgrade/9PN4LLBR8RCH"},{"name":"Rockstar Support — GTA+ bonus renewal","url":"https://support.rockstargames.com/articles/3SZF8cy8dG7lHsLf38uWK1/redeeming-the-one-month-gta-membership-included-with-your-grand-theft-auto-vi-pre-order"}],"body":["Launch is November 19, 2026 on PS5 and Xbox Series X|S. Digital preload began November 10. Rockstar lists up to 212 GB of preload space depending on device; check your console’s current requirement and leave room for updates.","US list prices are $79.99 Standard and $99.99 Ultimate. The $20 Ultimate upgrade is sold separately. Both editions share the November 19 launch; preloading is preparation, not playable access.","Boxed Standard contains a download code, not a disc; match its region to your account. Ultimate is digital, and its bonus content unlocks across story chapters rather than all arriving immediately.","Eligible digital purchases before November 20 include the Vintage Vice City Pack and a month of GTA+. Physical bonus availability is limited by stock. Redeemed GTA+ renews monthly until canceled; review the subscription before claiming it."]}},"es":{"police":{"name":"Planea tu huida","summary":"Rompe la persecución y después ocúpate de las pistas que dejas.","sections":[{"title":"Lee la respuesta policial","body":"El sistema alcanza seis estrellas. Vigila testigos, alarmas y rastreadores: actuar con discreción y preparar una salida importa antes de que empiece la persecución.","image":"assets/hd/photo-47.webp"},{"title":"Comprueba qué saben","body":"Los identificadores observados incluyen rostro o descripción física, ropa, cámaras, arma, acompañante y vehículo. Cambia lo que hayan identificado; no supongas que un disfraz borra todas las pistas.","image":"assets/hd/photo-56.webp"},{"title":"Mira más allá del radar","body":"En el sistema descrito, los policías ya no aparecen como simples iconos con conos de visión en el minimapa. Focus ayuda a resaltar peligros, pero no sustituye observar la calle.","image":"assets/hd/photo-41.webp"},{"title":"Sal de la zona caliente","body":"La zona del delito puede conservar atención policial después de escapar. Rompe la línea de visión, considera otro transporte y revisa los indicadores antes de volver. No hay un temporizador fijo ni una regla universal de cambiar toda la ropa.","image":"assets/hd/photo-8.webp"}],"sources":[{"name":"IGN — Rob Nelson interview","url":"https://www.bestbuy.com/gamers/gamers-articles/pcmcat1791490206931"},{"name":"Edge — GTA VI cover preview","url":"https://www.gamesradar.com/edge/gtavi-cover/"},{"name":"GamesRadar — six-star wanted system","url":"https://www.gamesradar.com/games/grand-theft-auto/gta-6-wanted-system-goes-up-to-6-stars-and-lets-police-track-your-face-your-clothes-and-your-car/"},{"name":"GamesRadar — police radar and Focus","url":"https://www.gamesradar.com/games/grand-theft-auto/rockstar-boss-says-gta-6s-police-can-be-harder-to-shake-off-than-before-but-its-fun-because-it-forces-you-to-think-more/"}],"body":["El sistema alcanza seis estrellas. Vigila testigos, alarmas y rastreadores: actuar con discreción y preparar una salida importa antes de que empiece la persecución.","Los identificadores observados incluyen rostro o descripción física, ropa, cámaras, arma, acompañante y vehículo. Cambia lo que hayan identificado; no supongas que un disfraz borra todas las pistas.","En el sistema descrito, los policías ya no aparecen como simples iconos con conos de visión en el minimapa. Focus ayuda a resaltar peligros, pero no sustituye observar la calle.","La zona del delito puede conservar atención policial después de escapar. Rompe la línea de visión, considera otro transporte y revisa los indicadores antes de volver. No hay un temporizador fijo ni una regla universal de cambiar toda la ropa."]},"criminal-profile":{"name":"Tu reputación criminal","summary":"Distingue la conducta, la presión policial y el romance.","sections":[{"title":"Dos personajes, dos patrones","body":"Jason y Lucia tienen perfiles independientes. La escalada innecesaria repetida moldea a cada criminal; una acción obligatoria de misión no se juzga igual que atacar a personas indefensas. Importa el contexto, incluido quién inició el enfrentamiento.","image":"assets/hd/photo-47.webp"},{"title":"Interpreta las etiquetas","body":"Los primeros avances citan Professional, Aggressive, Violent y Psycho. Edge describe después un recorrido de Professional a Irredeemable. No forman una escala final confirmada de cinco niveles.","image":"assets/hd/photo-12.webp"},{"title":"Una consecuencia importante","body":"Los avances describen un estado agrietado o destrozado que no se recupera durante esa partida. No se conoce el umbral exacto ni si equivale a Irredeemable. No dependas de un truco para revertirlo.","image":"assets/hd/photo-56.webp"},{"title":"Actúa con moderación","body":"Controlar la situación sin daño innecesario es el enfoque práctico. Cambiarse o borrar pruebas afecta a la identificación policial, no garantiza restaurar la reputación. Ocultar avisos no desactiva el seguimiento.","image":"assets/hd/photo-39.webp"}],"sources":[{"name":"IGN — Rob Nelson interview","url":"https://www.bestbuy.com/gamers/gamers-articles/pcmcat1791490206931"},{"name":"Edge — GTA VI cover preview","url":"https://www.gamesradar.com/edge/gtavi-cover/"},{"name":"PC Gamer — Criminal Profile preview reporting","url":"https://www.pcgamer.com/games/grand-theft-auto/gta-6s-criminal-profile-system-sounds-pretty-interesting-isnt-a-direct-copy-of-red-deads-honor-system/"},{"name":"Famitsu — developer interview","url":"https://www.famitsu.com/article/202608/85753"}],"body":["Jason y Lucia tienen perfiles independientes. La escalada innecesaria repetida moldea a cada criminal; una acción obligatoria de misión no se juzga igual que atacar a personas indefensas. Importa el contexto, incluido quién inició el enfrentamiento.","Los primeros avances citan Professional, Aggressive, Violent y Psycho. Edge describe después un recorrido de Professional a Irredeemable. No forman una escala final confirmada de cinco niveles.","Los avances describen un estado agrietado o destrozado que no se recupera durante esa partida. No se conoce el umbral exacto ni si equivale a Irredeemable. No dependas de un truco para revertirlo.","Controlar la situación sin daño innecesario es el enfoque práctico. Cambiarse o borrar pruebas afecta a la identificación policial, no garantiza restaurar la reputación. Ocultar avisos no desactiva el seguimiento."]},"relationship-status":{"name":"Compañeros a tu manera","summary":"El romance moldea la relación; cooperar no lo exige.","sections":[{"title":"Decide su cercanía","body":"Jason y Lucia siguen siendo compañeros capaces aunque no mantengan un romance estrecho. Cultivar la relación es opcional: no es una mejora de combate obligatoria ni una condición para colaborar bien.","image":"assets/hd/photo-39.webp"},{"title":"Haz espacio entre trabajos","body":"Salidas, conversaciones, mensajes y algunos delitos compartidos ofrecen tiempo juntos. Paseos por la playa, kayak, zoológico y estudio de animales son ejemplos; no todas las actividades tienen modo para dos confirmado.","image":"assets/hd/photo-15.webp"},{"title":"Observa la relación","body":"Edge describe cuatro niveles de cercanía. La atención y el tiempo juntos importan; ignorar el contacto puede afectarlos. Los umbrales, el ritmo de deterioro y todas las recompensas de afecto no se han anunciado.","image":"assets/hd/photo-70.webp"},{"title":"Habrá consecuencias narrativas","body":"La cercanía puede influir en el desarrollo de la historia y en las muestras de afecto. No hay una guía verificada de finales o rupturas permanentes. El Perfil Criminal de cada personaje es independiente.","image":"assets/hd/photo-76.webp"}],"sources":[{"name":"IGN — Rob Nelson interview","url":"https://www.bestbuy.com/gamers/gamers-articles/pcmcat1791490206931"},{"name":"Edge — four-point closeness scale","url":"https://www.gamesradar.com/edge/gtavi-cover/"},{"name":"Famitsu — developer interview","url":"https://www.famitsu.com/article/202608/85753"}],"body":["Jason y Lucia siguen siendo compañeros capaces aunque no mantengan un romance estrecho. Cultivar la relación es opcional: no es una mejora de combate obligatoria ni una condición para colaborar bien.","Salidas, conversaciones, mensajes y algunos delitos compartidos ofrecen tiempo juntos. Paseos por la playa, kayak, zoológico y estudio de animales son ejemplos; no todas las actividades tienen modo para dos confirmado.","Edge describe cuatro niveles de cercanía. La atención y el tiempo juntos importan; ignorar el contacto puede afectarlos. Los umbrales, el ritmo de deterioro y todas las recompensas de afecto no se han anunciado.","La cercanía puede influir en el desarrollo de la historia y en las muestras de afecto. No hay una guía verificada de finales o rupturas permanentes. El Perfil Criminal de cada personaje es independiente."]},"launch":{"name":"Lanzamiento, espacio y ediciones","summary":"Prepara la consola, revisa la edición y conoce cuándo llegan los extras.","sections":[{"title":"Prepara la consola","body":"El lanzamiento es el 19 de noviembre de 2026 en PS5 y Xbox Series X|S. La precarga digital comenzó el 10 de noviembre. Rockstar indica hasta 212 GB según el dispositivo; consulta el requisito actual de tu consola y deja espacio para actualizaciones.","image":"assets/hd/photo-39.webp"},{"title":"Elige edición","body":"Los precios de lista en EE. UU. son $79,99 para Standard y $99,99 para Ultimate. La mejora Ultimate cuesta $20 por separado. Ambas salen el 19 de noviembre; precargar no permite jugar antes.","image":"assets/hd/photo-6.webp"},{"title":"Comprueba el contenido","body":"Standard en caja contiene un código de descarga, no un disco; comprueba la región de tu cuenta. Ultimate es digital y sus extras se desbloquean durante distintos capítulos, no todos al empezar.","image":"assets/hd/photo-42.webp"},{"title":"Revisa las condiciones","body":"Las compras digitales elegibles anteriores al 20 de noviembre incluyen Vintage Vice City Pack y un mes de GTA+. Los extras físicos dependen de existencias. GTA+ se renueva mensualmente hasta cancelarlo; revisa la suscripción antes de canjearla.","image":"assets/hd/photo-104.webp"}],"sources":[{"name":"Rockstar Support — editions and versions","url":"https://support.rockstargames.com/articles/4QfG4FmZCf5W1gS8jy4UVT/grand-theft-auto-vi-platform-editions-and-versions"},{"name":"Rockstar Support — preload FAQ","url":"https://support.rockstargames.com/articles/7nPqOA2uCbpEQHXx7KVrYd/grand-theft-auto-vi-pre-load-faq"},{"name":"Take-Two — US edition prices","url":"https://www.take2games.com/ir/news/rockstar-games-announces-pre-orders-grand-theft-auto-vi"},{"name":"Xbox US — Ultimate Edition Upgrade","url":"https://www.xbox.com/en-us/games/store/grand-theft-auto-vi-ultimate-edition-upgrade/9PN4LLBR8RCH"},{"name":"Rockstar Support — GTA+ bonus renewal","url":"https://support.rockstargames.com/articles/3SZF8cy8dG7lHsLf38uWK1/redeeming-the-one-month-gta-membership-included-with-your-grand-theft-auto-vi-pre-order"}],"body":["El lanzamiento es el 19 de noviembre de 2026 en PS5 y Xbox Series X|S. La precarga digital comenzó el 10 de noviembre. Rockstar indica hasta 212 GB según el dispositivo; consulta el requisito actual de tu consola y deja espacio para actualizaciones.","Los precios de lista en EE. UU. son $79,99 para Standard y $99,99 para Ultimate. La mejora Ultimate cuesta $20 por separado. Ambas salen el 19 de noviembre; precargar no permite jugar antes.","Standard en caja contiene un código de descarga, no un disco; comprueba la región de tu cuenta. Ultimate es digital y sus extras se desbloquean durante distintos capítulos, no todos al empezar.","Las compras digitales elegibles anteriores al 20 de noviembre incluyen Vintage Vice City Pack y un mes de GTA+. Los extras físicos dependen de existencias. GTA+ se renueva mensualmente hasta cancelarlo; revisa la suscripción antes de canjearla."]}},"pt-br":{"police":{"name":"Planeje sua fuga","summary":"Encerre a perseguição e depois cuide das pistas que deixou.","sections":[{"title":"Entenda a resposta","body":"O sistema chega a seis estrelas. Observe testemunhas, alarmes e rastreadores: discrição e uma saída planejada importam antes de a perseguição começar.","image":"assets/hd/photo-47.webp"},{"title":"Confira o que sabem","body":"Os identificadores observados incluem rosto ou descrição física, roupa, câmeras, arma, parceiro e veículo. Mude o que foi identificado; não presuma que um disfarce apaga todas as pistas.","image":"assets/hd/photo-56.webp"},{"title":"Olhe além do radar","body":"No sistema descrito, policiais não aparecem como simples ícones com cones de visão no minimapa. Focus ajuda a destacar perigos, mas não substitui observar a rua.","image":"assets/hd/photo-41.webp"},{"title":"Saia da área quente","body":"O local do crime pode manter atenção policial após a fuga. Quebre a linha de visão, considere outro transporte e confira os indicadores antes de voltar. Não há tempo fixo nem regra universal de trocar toda a roupa.","image":"assets/hd/photo-8.webp"}],"sources":[{"name":"IGN — Rob Nelson interview","url":"https://www.bestbuy.com/gamers/gamers-articles/pcmcat1791490206931"},{"name":"Edge — GTA VI cover preview","url":"https://www.gamesradar.com/edge/gtavi-cover/"},{"name":"GamesRadar — six-star wanted system","url":"https://www.gamesradar.com/games/grand-theft-auto/gta-6-wanted-system-goes-up-to-6-stars-and-lets-police-track-your-face-your-clothes-and-your-car/"},{"name":"GamesRadar — police radar and Focus","url":"https://www.gamesradar.com/games/grand-theft-auto/rockstar-boss-says-gta-6s-police-can-be-harder-to-shake-off-than-before-but-its-fun-because-it-forces-you-to-think-more/"}],"body":["O sistema chega a seis estrelas. Observe testemunhas, alarmes e rastreadores: discrição e uma saída planejada importam antes de a perseguição começar.","Os identificadores observados incluem rosto ou descrição física, roupa, câmeras, arma, parceiro e veículo. Mude o que foi identificado; não presuma que um disfarce apaga todas as pistas.","No sistema descrito, policiais não aparecem como simples ícones com cones de visão no minimapa. Focus ajuda a destacar perigos, mas não substitui observar a rua.","O local do crime pode manter atenção policial após a fuga. Quebre a linha de visão, considere outro transporte e confira os indicadores antes de voltar. Não há tempo fixo nem regra universal de trocar toda a roupa."]},"criminal-profile":{"name":"Sua reputação criminal","summary":"Separe comportamento, pressão policial e romance.","sections":[{"title":"Dois personagens, dois padrões","body":"Jason e Lucia têm perfis independentes. Escalada desnecessária repetida molda cada criminoso; uma ação exigida pela missão não é julgada como atacar pessoas indefesas. O contexto importa, inclusive quem começou o confronto.","image":"assets/hd/photo-47.webp"},{"title":"Leia os rótulos com cuidado","body":"Prévias iniciais citam Professional, Aggressive, Violent e Psycho. A Edge descreve depois uma faixa de Professional a Irredeemable. Isso não estabelece uma escala final confirmada de cinco níveis.","image":"assets/hd/photo-12.webp"},{"title":"Uma consequência importante","body":"As prévias descrevem um estado rachado ou estilhaçado sem recuperação naquela partida. O limite exato e sua equivalência a Irredeemable não foram estabelecidos. Não dependa de um truque para recuperá-lo.","image":"assets/hd/photo-56.webp"},{"title":"Prefira o controle","body":"Controlar a situação sem dano desnecessário é a abordagem prática. Trocar de roupa ou apagar provas afeta a identificação policial, não garante restaurar a reputação. Ocultar notificações não desativa o acompanhamento.","image":"assets/hd/photo-39.webp"}],"sources":[{"name":"IGN — Rob Nelson interview","url":"https://www.bestbuy.com/gamers/gamers-articles/pcmcat1791490206931"},{"name":"Edge — GTA VI cover preview","url":"https://www.gamesradar.com/edge/gtavi-cover/"},{"name":"PC Gamer — Criminal Profile preview reporting","url":"https://www.pcgamer.com/games/grand-theft-auto/gta-6s-criminal-profile-system-sounds-pretty-interesting-isnt-a-direct-copy-of-red-deads-honor-system/"},{"name":"Famitsu — developer interview","url":"https://www.famitsu.com/article/202608/85753"}],"body":["Jason e Lucia têm perfis independentes. Escalada desnecessária repetida molda cada criminoso; uma ação exigida pela missão não é julgada como atacar pessoas indefesas. O contexto importa, inclusive quem começou o confronto.","Prévias iniciais citam Professional, Aggressive, Violent e Psycho. A Edge descreve depois uma faixa de Professional a Irredeemable. Isso não estabelece uma escala final confirmada de cinco níveis.","As prévias descrevem um estado rachado ou estilhaçado sem recuperação naquela partida. O limite exato e sua equivalência a Irredeemable não foram estabelecidos. Não dependa de um truque para recuperá-lo.","Controlar a situação sem dano desnecessário é a abordagem prática. Trocar de roupa ou apagar provas afeta a identificação policial, não garante restaurar a reputação. Ocultar notificações não desativa o acompanhamento."]},"relationship-status":{"name":"Parceiros do seu jeito","summary":"O romance molda a relação; a cooperação não depende dele.","sections":[{"title":"Decida a proximidade","body":"Jason e Lucia continuam parceiros capazes mesmo sem um romance próximo. Cultivar a relação é opcional, não uma melhoria de combate obrigatória ou condição para cooperar bem.","image":"assets/hd/photo-39.webp"},{"title":"Reserve tempo entre trabalhos","body":"Passeios, conversas, mensagens e alguns crimes juntos dão espaço à dupla. Praia, caiaque, zoológico e estudo de animais são exemplos; nem toda atividade tem modo em dupla confirmado.","image":"assets/hd/photo-15.webp"},{"title":"Acompanhe a relação","body":"A Edge descreve quatro níveis de proximidade. Atenção e tempo juntos importam; ignorar contato pode afetá-los. Limites, ritmo de desgaste e todas as recompensas de afeto não foram anunciados.","image":"assets/hd/photo-70.webp"},{"title":"Espere efeitos na história","body":"A proximidade pode influenciar o desenrolar da história e as demonstrações de carinho. Não há guia verificado de finais ou separações permanentes. O Perfil Criminal de cada personagem é independente.","image":"assets/hd/photo-76.webp"}],"sources":[{"name":"IGN — Rob Nelson interview","url":"https://www.bestbuy.com/gamers/gamers-articles/pcmcat1791490206931"},{"name":"Edge — four-point closeness scale","url":"https://www.gamesradar.com/edge/gtavi-cover/"},{"name":"Famitsu — developer interview","url":"https://www.famitsu.com/article/202608/85753"}],"body":["Jason e Lucia continuam parceiros capazes mesmo sem um romance próximo. Cultivar a relação é opcional, não uma melhoria de combate obrigatória ou condição para cooperar bem.","Passeios, conversas, mensagens e alguns crimes juntos dão espaço à dupla. Praia, caiaque, zoológico e estudo de animais são exemplos; nem toda atividade tem modo em dupla confirmado.","A Edge descreve quatro níveis de proximidade. Atenção e tempo juntos importam; ignorar contato pode afetá-los. Limites, ritmo de desgaste e todas as recompensas de afeto não foram anunciados.","A proximidade pode influenciar o desenrolar da história e as demonstrações de carinho. Não há guia verificado de finais ou separações permanentes. O Perfil Criminal de cada personagem é independente."]},"launch":{"name":"Lançamento, espaço e edições","summary":"Prepare o console, confira a edição e saiba quando os extras liberam.","sections":[{"title":"Prepare seu console","body":"O lançamento é em 19 de novembro de 2026 para PS5 e Xbox Series X|S. A pré-carga digital começou em 10 de novembro. A Rockstar indica até 212 GB conforme o aparelho; confira o requisito atual do console e reserve espaço para atualizações.","image":"assets/hd/photo-39.webp"},{"title":"Escolha a edição","body":"Os preços de tabela nos EUA são US$79,99 para Standard e US$99,99 para Ultimate. A melhoria Ultimate custa US$20 separadamente. Ambas lançam em 19 de novembro; pré-carregar não libera o jogo antes.","image":"assets/hd/photo-6.webp"},{"title":"Confira o que recebe","body":"Standard em caixa contém código de download, sem disco; confira a região da conta. Ultimate é digital e seus extras liberam ao longo dos capítulos, não todos imediatamente.","image":"assets/hd/photo-42.webp"},{"title":"Confira as condições","body":"Compras digitais elegíveis antes de 20 de novembro incluem Vintage Vice City Pack e um mês de GTA+. Bônus físicos dependem de estoque. GTA+ renova mensalmente até ser cancelado; confira a assinatura antes de resgatar.","image":"assets/hd/photo-104.webp"}],"sources":[{"name":"Rockstar Support — editions and versions","url":"https://support.rockstargames.com/articles/4QfG4FmZCf5W1gS8jy4UVT/grand-theft-auto-vi-platform-editions-and-versions"},{"name":"Rockstar Support — preload FAQ","url":"https://support.rockstargames.com/articles/7nPqOA2uCbpEQHXx7KVrYd/grand-theft-auto-vi-pre-load-faq"},{"name":"Take-Two — US edition prices","url":"https://www.take2games.com/ir/news/rockstar-games-announces-pre-orders-grand-theft-auto-vi"},{"name":"Xbox US — Ultimate Edition Upgrade","url":"https://www.xbox.com/en-us/games/store/grand-theft-auto-vi-ultimate-edition-upgrade/9PN4LLBR8RCH"},{"name":"Rockstar Support — GTA+ bonus renewal","url":"https://support.rockstargames.com/articles/3SZF8cy8dG7lHsLf38uWK1/redeeming-the-one-month-gta-membership-included-with-your-grand-theft-auto-vi-pre-order"}],"body":["O lançamento é em 19 de novembro de 2026 para PS5 e Xbox Series X|S. A pré-carga digital começou em 10 de novembro. A Rockstar indica até 212 GB conforme o aparelho; confira o requisito atual do console e reserve espaço para atualizações.","Os preços de tabela nos EUA são US$79,99 para Standard e US$99,99 para Ultimate. A melhoria Ultimate custa US$20 separadamente. Ambas lançam em 19 de novembro; pré-carregar não libera o jogo antes.","Standard em caixa contém código de download, sem disco; confira a região da conta. Ultimate é digital e seus extras liberam ao longo dos capítulos, não todos imediatamente.","Compras digitais elegíveis antes de 20 de novembro incluem Vintage Vice City Pack e um mês de GTA+. Bônus físicos dependem de estoque. GTA+ renova mensalmente até ser cancelado; confira a assinatura antes de resgatar."]}},"de":{"police":{"name":"Plane deine Flucht","summary":"Beende die Verfolgung und kümmere dich dann um deine Spuren.","sections":[{"title":"Die Reaktion einschätzen","body":"Das Fahndungssystem reicht bis sechs Sterne. Achte auf Zeugen, Alarme und Peilsender: Ein unauffälliges Vorgehen und ein Fluchtplan zählen schon vor der Verfolgung.","image":"assets/hd/photo-47.webp"},{"title":"Was weiß die Polizei?","body":"Beobachtete Merkmale sind Gesicht oder Personenbeschreibung, Kleidung, Kamerabeweise, Waffe, Begleitung und Fahrzeug. Ändere identifizierte Merkmale; eine Verkleidung löscht nicht automatisch alle Spuren.","image":"assets/hd/photo-56.webp"},{"title":"Über das Radar hinausblicken","body":"Im beschriebenen System erscheinen Polizisten nicht mehr als einfache Minikarten-Symbole mit Sichtkegeln. Focus kann Gefahren hervorheben, ersetzt aber keinen Blick auf die Straße.","image":"assets/hd/photo-41.webp"},{"title":"Das heiße Gebiet verlassen","body":"Ein Tatort kann auch nach der Flucht unter Beobachtung bleiben. Unterbrich Sichtkontakt, erwäge ein anderes Fahrzeug und prüfe die Anzeigen vor der Rückkehr. Ein fester Timer oder grundsätzlich kompletter Kleidungswechsel ist nicht belegt.","image":"assets/hd/photo-8.webp"}],"sources":[{"name":"IGN — Rob Nelson interview","url":"https://www.bestbuy.com/gamers/gamers-articles/pcmcat1791490206931"},{"name":"Edge — GTA VI cover preview","url":"https://www.gamesradar.com/edge/gtavi-cover/"},{"name":"GamesRadar — six-star wanted system","url":"https://www.gamesradar.com/games/grand-theft-auto/gta-6-wanted-system-goes-up-to-6-stars-and-lets-police-track-your-face-your-clothes-and-your-car/"},{"name":"GamesRadar — police radar and Focus","url":"https://www.gamesradar.com/games/grand-theft-auto/rockstar-boss-says-gta-6s-police-can-be-harder-to-shake-off-than-before-but-its-fun-because-it-forces-you-to-think-more/"}],"body":["Das Fahndungssystem reicht bis sechs Sterne. Achte auf Zeugen, Alarme und Peilsender: Ein unauffälliges Vorgehen und ein Fluchtplan zählen schon vor der Verfolgung.","Beobachtete Merkmale sind Gesicht oder Personenbeschreibung, Kleidung, Kamerabeweise, Waffe, Begleitung und Fahrzeug. Ändere identifizierte Merkmale; eine Verkleidung löscht nicht automatisch alle Spuren.","Im beschriebenen System erscheinen Polizisten nicht mehr als einfache Minikarten-Symbole mit Sichtkegeln. Focus kann Gefahren hervorheben, ersetzt aber keinen Blick auf die Straße.","Ein Tatort kann auch nach der Flucht unter Beobachtung bleiben. Unterbrich Sichtkontakt, erwäge ein anderes Fahrzeug und prüfe die Anzeigen vor der Rückkehr. Ein fester Timer oder grundsätzlich kompletter Kleidungswechsel ist nicht belegt."]},"criminal-profile":{"name":"Dein krimineller Ruf","summary":"Trenne Verhalten, Fahndungsdruck und Romantik.","sections":[{"title":"Zwei Figuren, zwei Muster","body":"Jason und Lucia haben unabhängige Profile. Wiederholte unnötige Eskalation prägt ihren kriminellen Stil; missionsbedingte Aktionen werden anders bewertet als Angriffe auf Wehrlose. Der Kontext zählt, auch wer den Streit begann.","image":"assets/hd/photo-47.webp"},{"title":"Bezeichnungen richtig einordnen","body":"Frühe Vorschauen nennen Professional, Aggressive, Violent und Psycho. Edge beschreibt später Professional bis Irredeemable. Das bestätigt keine endgültige Leiter mit fünf Stufen.","image":"assets/hd/photo-12.webp"},{"title":"Eine wichtige Konsequenz","body":"Vorschauen beschreiben einen rissigen oder zerbrochenen Zustand ohne Erholung in diesem Durchlauf. Der genaue Schwellenwert und eine Gleichsetzung mit Irredeemable sind nicht belegt. Verlass dich auf keinen Rücksetztrick.","image":"assets/hd/photo-56.webp"},{"title":"Kontrolle statt unnötiger Gewalt","body":"Eine Situation ohne unnötigen Schaden zu kontrollieren ist der praktische Ansatz. Kleidung oder Beweise betreffen die polizeiliche Erkennung, keinen belegten Ruf-Reset. Ausgeblendete Hinweise schalten das System nicht ab.","image":"assets/hd/photo-39.webp"}],"sources":[{"name":"IGN — Rob Nelson interview","url":"https://www.bestbuy.com/gamers/gamers-articles/pcmcat1791490206931"},{"name":"Edge — GTA VI cover preview","url":"https://www.gamesradar.com/edge/gtavi-cover/"},{"name":"PC Gamer — Criminal Profile preview reporting","url":"https://www.pcgamer.com/games/grand-theft-auto/gta-6s-criminal-profile-system-sounds-pretty-interesting-isnt-a-direct-copy-of-red-deads-honor-system/"},{"name":"Famitsu — developer interview","url":"https://www.famitsu.com/article/202608/85753"}],"body":["Jason und Lucia haben unabhängige Profile. Wiederholte unnötige Eskalation prägt ihren kriminellen Stil; missionsbedingte Aktionen werden anders bewertet als Angriffe auf Wehrlose. Der Kontext zählt, auch wer den Streit begann.","Frühe Vorschauen nennen Professional, Aggressive, Violent und Psycho. Edge beschreibt später Professional bis Irredeemable. Das bestätigt keine endgültige Leiter mit fünf Stufen.","Vorschauen beschreiben einen rissigen oder zerbrochenen Zustand ohne Erholung in diesem Durchlauf. Der genaue Schwellenwert und eine Gleichsetzung mit Irredeemable sind nicht belegt. Verlass dich auf keinen Rücksetztrick.","Eine Situation ohne unnötigen Schaden zu kontrollieren ist der praktische Ansatz. Kleidung oder Beweise betreffen die polizeiliche Erkennung, keinen belegten Ruf-Reset. Ausgeblendete Hinweise schalten das System nicht ab."]},"relationship-status":{"name":"Partner auf deine Art","summary":"Romantik prägt die Beziehung; Zusammenarbeit braucht sie nicht.","sections":[{"title":"Über die Nähe entscheiden","body":"Jason und Lucia bleiben auch ohne enge Romanze fähige Komplizen. Beziehungspflege ist optional, kein erzwungenes Kampf-Upgrade und keine Voraussetzung für zuverlässige Zusammenarbeit.","image":"assets/hd/photo-39.webp"},{"title":"Zeit zwischen den Jobs","body":"Ausflüge, Gespräche, Nachrichten und manche gemeinsamen Verbrechen schaffen Zeit zu zweit. Strandspaziergänge, Kajak, Zoo und Tierbeobachtung sind Beispiele; nicht jede Aktivität hat einen bestätigten Zweiermodus.","image":"assets/hd/photo-15.webp"},{"title":"Den Beziehungsstatus beachten","body":"Edge beschreibt vier Nähe-Stufen. Aufmerksamkeit und gemeinsame Zeit zählen; ignorierter Kontakt kann sich auswirken. Genaue Schwellenwerte, Verfallszeiten und sämtliche Zuneigungsbelohnungen sind nicht bekannt.","image":"assets/hd/photo-70.webp"},{"title":"Mit Folgen für die Geschichte rechnen","body":"Nähe kann den Verlauf der Geschichte und Zuneigung beeinflussen. Konkrete Enden und dauerhafte Trennungsregeln sind kein verifizierter Leitfaden. Das Criminal Profile jeder Figur bleibt ein getrenntes System.","image":"assets/hd/photo-76.webp"}],"sources":[{"name":"IGN — Rob Nelson interview","url":"https://www.bestbuy.com/gamers/gamers-articles/pcmcat1791490206931"},{"name":"Edge — four-point closeness scale","url":"https://www.gamesradar.com/edge/gtavi-cover/"},{"name":"Famitsu — developer interview","url":"https://www.famitsu.com/article/202608/85753"}],"body":["Jason und Lucia bleiben auch ohne enge Romanze fähige Komplizen. Beziehungspflege ist optional, kein erzwungenes Kampf-Upgrade und keine Voraussetzung für zuverlässige Zusammenarbeit.","Ausflüge, Gespräche, Nachrichten und manche gemeinsamen Verbrechen schaffen Zeit zu zweit. Strandspaziergänge, Kajak, Zoo und Tierbeobachtung sind Beispiele; nicht jede Aktivität hat einen bestätigten Zweiermodus.","Edge beschreibt vier Nähe-Stufen. Aufmerksamkeit und gemeinsame Zeit zählen; ignorierter Kontakt kann sich auswirken. Genaue Schwellenwerte, Verfallszeiten und sämtliche Zuneigungsbelohnungen sind nicht bekannt.","Nähe kann den Verlauf der Geschichte und Zuneigung beeinflussen. Konkrete Enden und dauerhafte Trennungsregeln sind kein verifizierter Leitfaden. Das Criminal Profile jeder Figur bleibt ein getrenntes System."]},"launch":{"name":"Start, Speicher und Editionen","summary":"Bereite die Konsole vor und prüfe Edition sowie Bonusfreischaltungen.","sections":[{"title":"Konsole vorbereiten","body":"Start ist am 19. November 2026 auf PS5 und Xbox Series X|S. Der digitale Preload begann am 10. November. Rockstar nennt je nach Gerät bis zu 212 GB; prüfe die aktuelle Konsolenangabe und halte Platz für Updates frei.","image":"assets/hd/photo-39.webp"},{"title":"Edition wählen","body":"US-Listenpreise: Standard $79,99, Ultimate $99,99. Das Ultimate-Upgrade kostet separat $20. Beide starten am 19. November; Vorabladen ist kein früher Spielzugang.","image":"assets/hd/photo-6.webp"},{"title":"Den Lieferumfang kennen","body":"Standard in der Box enthält einen Downloadcode, keine Disc. Prüfe die Kontoregion. Ultimate ist digital; Bonusinhalte werden im Verlauf der Kapitel freigeschaltet und stehen nicht sofort komplett bereit.","image":"assets/hd/photo-42.webp"},{"title":"Bonusbedingungen prüfen","body":"Berechtigte Digitalkäufe vor dem 20. November enthalten das Vintage Vice City Pack und einen Monat GTA+. Physische Boni gelten nach Vorrat. Eingelöstes GTA+ verlängert sich monatlich bis zur Kündigung; prüfe das Abo vor der Einlösung.","image":"assets/hd/photo-104.webp"}],"sources":[{"name":"Rockstar Support — editions and versions","url":"https://support.rockstargames.com/articles/4QfG4FmZCf5W1gS8jy4UVT/grand-theft-auto-vi-platform-editions-and-versions"},{"name":"Rockstar Support — preload FAQ","url":"https://support.rockstargames.com/articles/7nPqOA2uCbpEQHXx7KVrYd/grand-theft-auto-vi-pre-load-faq"},{"name":"Take-Two — US edition prices","url":"https://www.take2games.com/ir/news/rockstar-games-announces-pre-orders-grand-theft-auto-vi"},{"name":"Xbox US — Ultimate Edition Upgrade","url":"https://www.xbox.com/en-us/games/store/grand-theft-auto-vi-ultimate-edition-upgrade/9PN4LLBR8RCH"},{"name":"Rockstar Support — GTA+ bonus renewal","url":"https://support.rockstargames.com/articles/3SZF8cy8dG7lHsLf38uWK1/redeeming-the-one-month-gta-membership-included-with-your-grand-theft-auto-vi-pre-order"}],"body":["Start ist am 19. November 2026 auf PS5 und Xbox Series X|S. Der digitale Preload begann am 10. November. Rockstar nennt je nach Gerät bis zu 212 GB; prüfe die aktuelle Konsolenangabe und halte Platz für Updates frei.","US-Listenpreise: Standard $79,99, Ultimate $99,99. Das Ultimate-Upgrade kostet separat $20. Beide starten am 19. November; Vorabladen ist kein früher Spielzugang.","Standard in der Box enthält einen Downloadcode, keine Disc. Prüfe die Kontoregion. Ultimate ist digital; Bonusinhalte werden im Verlauf der Kapitel freigeschaltet und stehen nicht sofort komplett bereit.","Berechtigte Digitalkäufe vor dem 20. November enthalten das Vintage Vice City Pack und einen Monat GTA+. Physische Boni gelten nach Vorrat. Eingelöstes GTA+ verlängert sich monatlich bis zur Kündigung; prüfe das Abo vor der Einlösung."]}},"fr":{"police":{"name":"Préparez votre fuite","summary":"Semez la poursuite, puis occupez-vous des indices laissés derrière vous.","sections":[{"title":"Évaluez la réaction","body":"La recherche peut atteindre six étoiles. Surveillez témoins, alarmes et traceurs : discrétion et itinéraire de sortie comptent avant le début de la poursuite.","image":"assets/hd/photo-47.webp"},{"title":"Vérifiez ce que sait la police","body":"Les identifiants observés incluent visage ou description physique, vêtements, caméras, arme, partenaire et véhicule. Modifiez les éléments identifiés ; un déguisement ne supprime pas automatiquement toutes les traces.","image":"assets/hd/photo-56.webp"},{"title":"Regardez au-delà du radar","body":"Dans le système décrit, les policiers ne sont plus de simples icônes avec cônes de vision sur la minicarte. Focus aide à signaler le danger sans remplacer l’observation de la rue.","image":"assets/hd/photo-41.webp"},{"title":"Quittez la zone chaude","body":"Un lieu de crime peut rester surveillé après votre fuite. Rompez le contact visuel, envisagez un autre véhicule et vérifiez les indicateurs avant de revenir. Aucun délai fixe ni changement intégral de tenue systématique n’est établi.","image":"assets/hd/photo-8.webp"}],"sources":[{"name":"IGN — Rob Nelson interview","url":"https://www.bestbuy.com/gamers/gamers-articles/pcmcat1791490206931"},{"name":"Edge — GTA VI cover preview","url":"https://www.gamesradar.com/edge/gtavi-cover/"},{"name":"GamesRadar — six-star wanted system","url":"https://www.gamesradar.com/games/grand-theft-auto/gta-6-wanted-system-goes-up-to-6-stars-and-lets-police-track-your-face-your-clothes-and-your-car/"},{"name":"GamesRadar — police radar and Focus","url":"https://www.gamesradar.com/games/grand-theft-auto/rockstar-boss-says-gta-6s-police-can-be-harder-to-shake-off-than-before-but-its-fun-because-it-forces-you-to-think-more/"}],"body":["La recherche peut atteindre six étoiles. Surveillez témoins, alarmes et traceurs : discrétion et itinéraire de sortie comptent avant le début de la poursuite.","Les identifiants observés incluent visage ou description physique, vêtements, caméras, arme, partenaire et véhicule. Modifiez les éléments identifiés ; un déguisement ne supprime pas automatiquement toutes les traces.","Dans le système décrit, les policiers ne sont plus de simples icônes avec cônes de vision sur la minicarte. Focus aide à signaler le danger sans remplacer l’observation de la rue.","Un lieu de crime peut rester surveillé après votre fuite. Rompez le contact visuel, envisagez un autre véhicule et vérifiez les indicateurs avant de revenir. Aucun délai fixe ni changement intégral de tenue systématique n’est établi."]},"criminal-profile":{"name":"Votre réputation criminelle","summary":"Distinguez comportement, pression policière et romance.","sections":[{"title":"Deux personnages, deux habitudes","body":"Jason et Lucia ont des profils indépendants. L’escalade inutile répétée façonne leur criminalité ; une action imposée par une mission n’est pas jugée comme une attaque sur des personnes sans défense. Le contexte compte, notamment l’origine du conflit.","image":"assets/hd/photo-47.webp"},{"title":"Interprétez les noms","body":"Les premiers aperçus citent Professional, Aggressive, Violent et Psycho. Edge décrit ensuite une progression de Professional à Irredeemable. Cela ne confirme pas une échelle finale de cinq niveaux.","image":"assets/hd/photo-12.webp"},{"title":"Une conséquence à surveiller","body":"Des aperçus décrivent un état fissuré ou brisé sans récupération dans cette partie. Son seuil exact et son équivalence à Irredeemable ne sont pas établis. Ne comptez pas sur une astuce pour l’effacer.","image":"assets/hd/photo-56.webp"},{"title":"Gardez le contrôle","body":"Maîtriser la situation sans dégâts inutiles est l’approche pratique. Changer de tenue ou effacer des preuves agit sur l’identification policière, pas sur une restauration prouvée du profil. Masquer les notifications ne désactive pas le suivi.","image":"assets/hd/photo-39.webp"}],"sources":[{"name":"IGN — Rob Nelson interview","url":"https://www.bestbuy.com/gamers/gamers-articles/pcmcat1791490206931"},{"name":"Edge — GTA VI cover preview","url":"https://www.gamesradar.com/edge/gtavi-cover/"},{"name":"PC Gamer — Criminal Profile preview reporting","url":"https://www.pcgamer.com/games/grand-theft-auto/gta-6s-criminal-profile-system-sounds-pretty-interesting-isnt-a-direct-copy-of-red-deads-honor-system/"},{"name":"Famitsu — developer interview","url":"https://www.famitsu.com/article/202608/85753"}],"body":["Jason et Lucia ont des profils indépendants. L’escalade inutile répétée façonne leur criminalité ; une action imposée par une mission n’est pas jugée comme une attaque sur des personnes sans défense. Le contexte compte, notamment l’origine du conflit.","Les premiers aperçus citent Professional, Aggressive, Violent et Psycho. Edge décrit ensuite une progression de Professional à Irredeemable. Cela ne confirme pas une échelle finale de cinq niveaux.","Des aperçus décrivent un état fissuré ou brisé sans récupération dans cette partie. Son seuil exact et son équivalence à Irredeemable ne sont pas établis. Ne comptez pas sur une astuce pour l’effacer.","Maîtriser la situation sans dégâts inutiles est l’approche pratique. Changer de tenue ou effacer des preuves agit sur l’identification policière, pas sur une restauration prouvée du profil. Masquer les notifications ne désactive pas le suivi."]},"relationship-status":{"name":"Partenaires à votre façon","summary":"La romance façonne la relation ; la coopération ne l’exige pas.","sections":[{"title":"Choisissez leur proximité","body":"Jason et Lucia restent des complices capables sans romance étroite. Entretenir leur relation est facultatif, pas une amélioration de combat imposée ni une condition pour coopérer efficacement.","image":"assets/hd/photo-39.webp"},{"title":"Du temps entre les coups","body":"Sorties, conversations, messages et certains crimes partagés rapprochent le duo. Plage, kayak, zoo et étude des animaux sont des exemples ; toutes les activités n’ont pas un mode à deux confirmé.","image":"assets/hd/photo-15.webp"},{"title":"Suivez la relation","body":"Edge décrit quatre degrés de proximité. Attention et temps ensemble comptent ; ignorer le contact peut jouer. Seuils exacts, délais de dégradation et toutes les récompenses d’affection restent inconnus.","image":"assets/hd/photo-70.webp"},{"title":"Des effets sur l’histoire","body":"La proximité peut influer sur le récit et les gestes affectueux. Les fins précises et les règles de rupture définitive ne sont pas vérifiées. Le Criminal Profile de chaque personnage reste distinct.","image":"assets/hd/photo-76.webp"}],"sources":[{"name":"IGN — Rob Nelson interview","url":"https://www.bestbuy.com/gamers/gamers-articles/pcmcat1791490206931"},{"name":"Edge — four-point closeness scale","url":"https://www.gamesradar.com/edge/gtavi-cover/"},{"name":"Famitsu — developer interview","url":"https://www.famitsu.com/article/202608/85753"}],"body":["Jason et Lucia restent des complices capables sans romance étroite. Entretenir leur relation est facultatif, pas une amélioration de combat imposée ni une condition pour coopérer efficacement.","Sorties, conversations, messages et certains crimes partagés rapprochent le duo. Plage, kayak, zoo et étude des animaux sont des exemples ; toutes les activités n’ont pas un mode à deux confirmé.","Edge décrit quatre degrés de proximité. Attention et temps ensemble comptent ; ignorer le contact peut jouer. Seuils exacts, délais de dégradation et toutes les récompenses d’affection restent inconnus.","La proximité peut influer sur le récit et les gestes affectueux. Les fins précises et les règles de rupture définitive ne sont pas vérifiées. Le Criminal Profile de chaque personnage reste distinct."]},"launch":{"name":"Sortie, stockage et éditions","summary":"Préparez la console, choisissez l’édition et comprenez les déblocages.","sections":[{"title":"Préparez votre console","body":"Sortie le 19 novembre 2026 sur PS5 et Xbox Series X|S. Le préchargement numérique a commencé le 10 novembre. Rockstar annonce jusqu’à 212 Go selon l’appareil ; vérifiez votre console et gardez de la place pour les mises à jour.","image":"assets/hd/photo-39.webp"},{"title":"Choisissez l’édition","body":"Prix catalogue aux États-Unis : Standard 79,99 $, Ultimate 99,99 $. La mise à niveau Ultimate coûte 20 $ séparément. Les deux sortent le 19 novembre ; précharger ne permet pas de jouer avant.","image":"assets/hd/photo-6.webp"},{"title":"Vérifiez le contenu","body":"Standard en boîte contient un code de téléchargement, sans disque ; vérifiez la région du compte. Ultimate est numérique et ses bonus se débloquent au fil des chapitres, pas tous immédiatement.","image":"assets/hd/photo-42.webp"},{"title":"Lisez les conditions","body":"Les achats numériques éligibles avant le 20 novembre incluent Vintage Vice City Pack et un mois de GTA+. Les bonus physiques dépendent des stocks. GTA+ se renouvelle chaque mois jusqu’à résiliation ; vérifiez l’abonnement avant activation.","image":"assets/hd/photo-104.webp"}],"sources":[{"name":"Rockstar Support — editions and versions","url":"https://support.rockstargames.com/articles/4QfG4FmZCf5W1gS8jy4UVT/grand-theft-auto-vi-platform-editions-and-versions"},{"name":"Rockstar Support — preload FAQ","url":"https://support.rockstargames.com/articles/7nPqOA2uCbpEQHXx7KVrYd/grand-theft-auto-vi-pre-load-faq"},{"name":"Take-Two — US edition prices","url":"https://www.take2games.com/ir/news/rockstar-games-announces-pre-orders-grand-theft-auto-vi"},{"name":"Xbox US — Ultimate Edition Upgrade","url":"https://www.xbox.com/en-us/games/store/grand-theft-auto-vi-ultimate-edition-upgrade/9PN4LLBR8RCH"},{"name":"Rockstar Support — GTA+ bonus renewal","url":"https://support.rockstargames.com/articles/3SZF8cy8dG7lHsLf38uWK1/redeeming-the-one-month-gta-membership-included-with-your-grand-theft-auto-vi-pre-order"}],"body":["Sortie le 19 novembre 2026 sur PS5 et Xbox Series X|S. Le préchargement numérique a commencé le 10 novembre. Rockstar annonce jusqu’à 212 Go selon l’appareil ; vérifiez votre console et gardez de la place pour les mises à jour.","Prix catalogue aux États-Unis : Standard 79,99 $, Ultimate 99,99 $. La mise à niveau Ultimate coûte 20 $ séparément. Les deux sortent le 19 novembre ; précharger ne permet pas de jouer avant.","Standard en boîte contient un code de téléchargement, sans disque ; vérifiez la région du compte. Ultimate est numérique et ses bonus se débloquent au fil des chapitres, pas tous immédiatement.","Les achats numériques éligibles avant le 20 novembre incluent Vintage Vice City Pack et un mois de GTA+. Les bonus physiques dépendent des stocks. GTA+ se renouvelle chaque mois jusqu’à résiliation ; vérifiez l’abonnement avant activation."]}},"it":{"police":{"name":"Prepara la fuga","summary":"Interrompi l’inseguimento, poi occupati degli indizi lasciati.","sections":[{"title":"Valuta la risposta","body":"Il sistema arriva a sei stelle. Tieni d’occhio testimoni, allarmi e localizzatori: discrezione e via d’uscita contano prima dell’inseguimento.","image":"assets/hd/photo-47.webp"},{"title":"Controlla cosa sanno","body":"Gli identificatori osservati includono volto o descrizione fisica, vestiti, telecamere, arma, compagno e veicolo. Cambia ciò che è stato identificato: un travestimento non cancella automaticamente ogni traccia.","image":"assets/hd/photo-56.webp"},{"title":"Guarda oltre il radar","body":"Nel sistema descritto, i poliziotti non appaiono più come semplici icone con coni visivi sulla minimappa. Focus può evidenziare i pericoli, ma non sostituisce osservare la strada.","image":"assets/hd/photo-41.webp"},{"title":"Lascia la zona calda","body":"Il luogo del crimine può restare sorvegliato dopo la fuga. Interrompi il contatto visivo, valuta un altro mezzo e controlla gli indicatori prima di tornare. Non sono stabiliti tempi fissi o un obbligo universale di cambiare ogni indumento.","image":"assets/hd/photo-8.webp"}],"sources":[{"name":"IGN — Rob Nelson interview","url":"https://www.bestbuy.com/gamers/gamers-articles/pcmcat1791490206931"},{"name":"Edge — GTA VI cover preview","url":"https://www.gamesradar.com/edge/gtavi-cover/"},{"name":"GamesRadar — six-star wanted system","url":"https://www.gamesradar.com/games/grand-theft-auto/gta-6-wanted-system-goes-up-to-6-stars-and-lets-police-track-your-face-your-clothes-and-your-car/"},{"name":"GamesRadar — police radar and Focus","url":"https://www.gamesradar.com/games/grand-theft-auto/rockstar-boss-says-gta-6s-police-can-be-harder-to-shake-off-than-before-but-its-fun-because-it-forces-you-to-think-more/"}],"body":["Il sistema arriva a sei stelle. Tieni d’occhio testimoni, allarmi e localizzatori: discrezione e via d’uscita contano prima dell’inseguimento.","Gli identificatori osservati includono volto o descrizione fisica, vestiti, telecamere, arma, compagno e veicolo. Cambia ciò che è stato identificato: un travestimento non cancella automaticamente ogni traccia.","Nel sistema descritto, i poliziotti non appaiono più come semplici icone con coni visivi sulla minimappa. Focus può evidenziare i pericoli, ma non sostituisce osservare la strada.","Il luogo del crimine può restare sorvegliato dopo la fuga. Interrompi il contatto visivo, valuta un altro mezzo e controlla gli indicatori prima di tornare. Non sono stabiliti tempi fissi o un obbligo universale di cambiare ogni indumento."]},"criminal-profile":{"name":"La tua reputazione criminale","summary":"Distingui comportamento, pressione della polizia e relazione.","sections":[{"title":"Due personaggi, due abitudini","body":"Jason e Lucia hanno profili indipendenti. L’escalation inutile ripetuta ne modella lo stile criminale; un’azione richiesta dalla missione non è giudicata come un attacco a persone indifese. Il contesto conta, incluso chi ha iniziato lo scontro.","image":"assets/hd/photo-47.webp"},{"title":"Interpreta le etichette","body":"Le prime anteprime citano Professional, Aggressive, Violent e Psycho. Edge descrive poi un percorso da Professional a Irredeemable. Non è una scala definitiva confermata di cinque livelli.","image":"assets/hd/photo-12.webp"},{"title":"Una conseguenza importante","body":"Le anteprime descrivono uno stato incrinato o frantumato senza recupero in quella partita. Soglia esatta ed equivalenza a Irredeemable non sono stabilite. Non affidarti a trucchi per annullarlo.","image":"assets/hd/photo-56.webp"},{"title":"Mantieni il controllo","body":"Gestire la situazione senza danni inutili è l’approccio pratico. Cambiare vestiti o cancellare prove riguarda l’identificazione della polizia, non un ripristino dimostrato della reputazione. Nascondere notifiche non disattiva il sistema.","image":"assets/hd/photo-39.webp"}],"sources":[{"name":"IGN — Rob Nelson interview","url":"https://www.bestbuy.com/gamers/gamers-articles/pcmcat1791490206931"},{"name":"Edge — GTA VI cover preview","url":"https://www.gamesradar.com/edge/gtavi-cover/"},{"name":"PC Gamer — Criminal Profile preview reporting","url":"https://www.pcgamer.com/games/grand-theft-auto/gta-6s-criminal-profile-system-sounds-pretty-interesting-isnt-a-direct-copy-of-red-deads-honor-system/"},{"name":"Famitsu — developer interview","url":"https://www.famitsu.com/article/202608/85753"}],"body":["Jason e Lucia hanno profili indipendenti. L’escalation inutile ripetuta ne modella lo stile criminale; un’azione richiesta dalla missione non è giudicata come un attacco a persone indifese. Il contesto conta, incluso chi ha iniziato lo scontro.","Le prime anteprime citano Professional, Aggressive, Violent e Psycho. Edge descrive poi un percorso da Professional a Irredeemable. Non è una scala definitiva confermata di cinque livelli.","Le anteprime descrivono uno stato incrinato o frantumato senza recupero in quella partita. Soglia esatta ed equivalenza a Irredeemable non sono stabilite. Non affidarti a trucchi per annullarlo.","Gestire la situazione senza danni inutili è l’approccio pratico. Cambiare vestiti o cancellare prove riguarda l’identificazione della polizia, non un ripristino dimostrato della reputazione. Nascondere notifiche non disattiva il sistema."]},"relationship-status":{"name":"Complici a modo tuo","summary":"Il romance modella la relazione; cooperare non lo richiede.","sections":[{"title":"Scegli quanto avvicinarli","body":"Jason e Lucia restano complici capaci anche senza una relazione romantica stretta. Coltivarla è facoltativo, non un potenziamento obbligatorio del combattimento o una condizione per collaborare bene.","image":"assets/hd/photo-39.webp"},{"title":"Trova tempo tra i colpi","body":"Uscite, conversazioni, messaggi e alcuni crimini insieme creano momenti di coppia. Spiaggia, kayak, zoo e studio degli animali sono esempi; non ogni attività ha una modalità a due confermata.","image":"assets/hd/photo-15.webp"},{"title":"Segui la relazione","body":"Edge descrive quattro livelli di vicinanza. Attenzione e tempo insieme contano; ignorare i contatti può incidere. Soglie, tempi di calo e tutte le ricompense affettive non sono stati annunciati.","image":"assets/hd/photo-70.webp"},{"title":"Aspettati effetti sulla storia","body":"La vicinanza può influenzare il racconto e i gesti affettuosi. Finali precisi e regole di separazione permanente non sono verificati. Il Criminal Profile di ciascun personaggio resta separato.","image":"assets/hd/photo-76.webp"}],"sources":[{"name":"IGN — Rob Nelson interview","url":"https://www.bestbuy.com/gamers/gamers-articles/pcmcat1791490206931"},{"name":"Edge — four-point closeness scale","url":"https://www.gamesradar.com/edge/gtavi-cover/"},{"name":"Famitsu — developer interview","url":"https://www.famitsu.com/article/202608/85753"}],"body":["Jason e Lucia restano complici capaci anche senza una relazione romantica stretta. Coltivarla è facoltativo, non un potenziamento obbligatorio del combattimento o una condizione per collaborare bene.","Uscite, conversazioni, messaggi e alcuni crimini insieme creano momenti di coppia. Spiaggia, kayak, zoo e studio degli animali sono esempi; non ogni attività ha una modalità a due confermata.","Edge descrive quattro livelli di vicinanza. Attenzione e tempo insieme contano; ignorare i contatti può incidere. Soglie, tempi di calo e tutte le ricompense affettive non sono stati annunciati.","La vicinanza può influenzare il racconto e i gesti affettuosi. Finali precisi e regole di separazione permanente non sono verificati. Il Criminal Profile di ciascun personaggio resta separato."]},"launch":{"name":"Uscita, spazio ed edizioni","summary":"Prepara la console, controlla l’edizione e scopri quando si sbloccano i bonus.","sections":[{"title":"Prepara la console","body":"Uscita il 19 novembre 2026 su PS5 e Xbox Series X|S. Il precaricamento digitale è iniziato il 10 novembre. Rockstar indica fino a 212 GB secondo il dispositivo: controlla la console e lascia spazio per gli aggiornamenti.","image":"assets/hd/photo-39.webp"},{"title":"Scegli l’edizione","body":"Prezzi di listino USA: Standard $79,99, Ultimate $99,99. L’upgrade Ultimate costa $20 separatamente. Entrambe escono il 19 novembre; precaricare non significa giocare prima.","image":"assets/hd/photo-6.webp"},{"title":"Controlla cosa ricevi","body":"Standard in confezione contiene un codice di download, non un disco; controlla la regione dell’account. Ultimate è digitale e i suoi bonus si sbloccano nei vari capitoli, non tutti subito.","image":"assets/hd/photo-42.webp"},{"title":"Leggi le condizioni","body":"Gli acquisti digitali idonei prima del 20 novembre includono Vintage Vice City Pack e un mese di GTA+. I bonus fisici dipendono dalle scorte. GTA+ si rinnova mensilmente fino alla disdetta: controlla l’abbonamento prima del riscatto.","image":"assets/hd/photo-104.webp"}],"sources":[{"name":"Rockstar Support — editions and versions","url":"https://support.rockstargames.com/articles/4QfG4FmZCf5W1gS8jy4UVT/grand-theft-auto-vi-platform-editions-and-versions"},{"name":"Rockstar Support — preload FAQ","url":"https://support.rockstargames.com/articles/7nPqOA2uCbpEQHXx7KVrYd/grand-theft-auto-vi-pre-load-faq"},{"name":"Take-Two — US edition prices","url":"https://www.take2games.com/ir/news/rockstar-games-announces-pre-orders-grand-theft-auto-vi"},{"name":"Xbox US — Ultimate Edition Upgrade","url":"https://www.xbox.com/en-us/games/store/grand-theft-auto-vi-ultimate-edition-upgrade/9PN4LLBR8RCH"},{"name":"Rockstar Support — GTA+ bonus renewal","url":"https://support.rockstargames.com/articles/3SZF8cy8dG7lHsLf38uWK1/redeeming-the-one-month-gta-membership-included-with-your-grand-theft-auto-vi-pre-order"}],"body":["Uscita il 19 novembre 2026 su PS5 e Xbox Series X|S. Il precaricamento digitale è iniziato il 10 novembre. Rockstar indica fino a 212 GB secondo il dispositivo: controlla la console e lascia spazio per gli aggiornamenti.","Prezzi di listino USA: Standard $79,99, Ultimate $99,99. L’upgrade Ultimate costa $20 separatamente. Entrambe escono il 19 novembre; precaricare non significa giocare prima.","Standard in confezione contiene un codice di download, non un disco; controlla la regione dell’account. Ultimate è digitale e i suoi bonus si sbloccano nei vari capitoli, non tutti subito.","Gli acquisti digitali idonei prima del 20 novembre includono Vintage Vice City Pack e un mese di GTA+. I bonus fisici dipendono dalle scorte. GTA+ si rinnova mensilmente fino alla disdetta: controlla l’abbonamento prima del riscatto."]}},"ru":{"police":{"name":"Планируйте побег","summary":"Уйдите от погони, а затем займитесь оставленными следами.","sections":[{"title":"Оцените реакцию","body":"Система розыска достигает шести звёзд. Учитывайте свидетелей, сигнализацию и маячки: скрытный подход и путь отхода важны ещё до погони.","image":"assets/hd/photo-47.webp"},{"title":"Проверьте, что известно полиции","body":"Среди наблюдавшихся признаков — лицо или внешность, одежда, записи камер, оружие, напарник и машина. Меняйте опознанные признаки: одна маскировка не обязательно стирает все следы.","image":"assets/hd/photo-56.webp"},{"title":"Смотрите не только на радар","body":"В описанной системе полицейские больше не показаны простыми значками с конусами обзора на мини-карте. Focus помогает выделять угрозы, но не заменяет наблюдение за улицей.","image":"assets/hd/photo-41.webp"},{"title":"Покиньте опасный район","body":"Место преступления может оставаться под наблюдением после побега. Разорвите визуальный контакт, подумайте о другой машине и проверьте индикаторы перед возвращением. Фиксированное время и обязательная полная смена одежды не установлены.","image":"assets/hd/photo-8.webp"}],"sources":[{"name":"IGN — Rob Nelson interview","url":"https://www.bestbuy.com/gamers/gamers-articles/pcmcat1791490206931"},{"name":"Edge — GTA VI cover preview","url":"https://www.gamesradar.com/edge/gtavi-cover/"},{"name":"GamesRadar — six-star wanted system","url":"https://www.gamesradar.com/games/grand-theft-auto/gta-6-wanted-system-goes-up-to-6-stars-and-lets-police-track-your-face-your-clothes-and-your-car/"},{"name":"GamesRadar — police radar and Focus","url":"https://www.gamesradar.com/games/grand-theft-auto/rockstar-boss-says-gta-6s-police-can-be-harder-to-shake-off-than-before-but-its-fun-because-it-forces-you-to-think-more/"}],"body":["Система розыска достигает шести звёзд. Учитывайте свидетелей, сигнализацию и маячки: скрытный подход и путь отхода важны ещё до погони.","Среди наблюдавшихся признаков — лицо или внешность, одежда, записи камер, оружие, напарник и машина. Меняйте опознанные признаки: одна маскировка не обязательно стирает все следы.","В описанной системе полицейские больше не показаны простыми значками с конусами обзора на мини-карте. Focus помогает выделять угрозы, но не заменяет наблюдение за улицей.","Место преступления может оставаться под наблюдением после побега. Разорвите визуальный контакт, подумайте о другой машине и проверьте индикаторы перед возвращением. Фиксированное время и обязательная полная смена одежды не установлены."]},"criminal-profile":{"name":"Ваша криминальная репутация","summary":"Различайте поведение, полицейский розыск и романтику.","sections":[{"title":"Два героя, два характера","body":"У Джейсона и Люсии независимые профили. Повторяющаяся ненужная эскалация формирует преступный стиль; обязательное действие миссии оценивается иначе, чем нападение на беззащитных. Контекст важен, включая то, кто начал конфликт.","image":"assets/hd/photo-47.webp"},{"title":"Правильно читайте названия","body":"Ранние превью называют Professional, Aggressive, Violent и Psycho. Edge позднее описывает диапазон от Professional до Irredeemable. Это не подтверждает единую окончательную шкалу из пяти ступеней.","image":"assets/hd/photo-12.webp"},{"title":"Важное последствие","body":"В превью описано треснувшее или разбитое состояние без восстановления в этом прохождении. Точный порог и соответствие Irredeemable не установлены. Не рассчитывайте на трюк для сброса.","image":"assets/hd/photo-56.webp"},{"title":"Сохраняйте контроль","body":"Практический подход — контролировать ситуацию без лишнего вреда. Смена одежды и удаление улик влияют на опознание полицией, но не доказанно сбрасывают репутацию. Скрытие уведомлений не выключает отслеживание.","image":"assets/hd/photo-39.webp"}],"sources":[{"name":"IGN — Rob Nelson interview","url":"https://www.bestbuy.com/gamers/gamers-articles/pcmcat1791490206931"},{"name":"Edge — GTA VI cover preview","url":"https://www.gamesradar.com/edge/gtavi-cover/"},{"name":"PC Gamer — Criminal Profile preview reporting","url":"https://www.pcgamer.com/games/grand-theft-auto/gta-6s-criminal-profile-system-sounds-pretty-interesting-isnt-a-direct-copy-of-red-deads-honor-system/"},{"name":"Famitsu — developer interview","url":"https://www.famitsu.com/article/202608/85753"}],"body":["У Джейсона и Люсии независимые профили. Повторяющаяся ненужная эскалация формирует преступный стиль; обязательное действие миссии оценивается иначе, чем нападение на беззащитных. Контекст важен, включая то, кто начал конфликт.","Ранние превью называют Professional, Aggressive, Violent и Psycho. Edge позднее описывает диапазон от Professional до Irredeemable. Это не подтверждает единую окончательную шкалу из пяти ступеней.","В превью описано треснувшее или разбитое состояние без восстановления в этом прохождении. Точный порог и соответствие Irredeemable не установлены. Не рассчитывайте на трюк для сброса.","Практический подход — контролировать ситуацию без лишнего вреда. Смена одежды и удаление улик влияют на опознание полицией, но не доказанно сбрасывают репутацию. Скрытие уведомлений не выключает отслеживание."]},"relationship-status":{"name":"Напарники по вашему выбору","summary":"Романтика влияет на отношения; сотрудничество её не требует.","sections":[{"title":"Выбирайте степень близости","body":"Джейсон и Люсия остаются надёжными сообщниками и без близкого романа. Развивать отношения необязательно: это не обязательное боевое улучшение и не условие эффективной совместной работы.","image":"assets/hd/photo-39.webp"},{"title":"Находите время между делами","body":"Прогулки, разговоры, сообщения и некоторые совместные преступления дают время вдвоём. Пляж, каяки, зоопарк и изучение животных — примеры; режим для двоих подтверждён не для каждого занятия.","image":"assets/hd/photo-15.webp"},{"title":"Следите за отношениями","body":"Edge описывает четыре уровня близости. Внимание и совместное время важны; игнорирование контактов может повлиять на связь. Точные пороги, сроки снижения и все награды за близость не объявлены.","image":"assets/hd/photo-70.webp"},{"title":"Ожидайте влияния на историю","body":"Близость может менять развитие истории и проявления привязанности. Конкретные концовки и правила постоянного расставания не проверены. Криминальный профиль каждого героя остаётся отдельной системой.","image":"assets/hd/photo-76.webp"}],"sources":[{"name":"IGN — Rob Nelson interview","url":"https://www.bestbuy.com/gamers/gamers-articles/pcmcat1791490206931"},{"name":"Edge — four-point closeness scale","url":"https://www.gamesradar.com/edge/gtavi-cover/"},{"name":"Famitsu — developer interview","url":"https://www.famitsu.com/article/202608/85753"}],"body":["Джейсон и Люсия остаются надёжными сообщниками и без близкого романа. Развивать отношения необязательно: это не обязательное боевое улучшение и не условие эффективной совместной работы.","Прогулки, разговоры, сообщения и некоторые совместные преступления дают время вдвоём. Пляж, каяки, зоопарк и изучение животных — примеры; режим для двоих подтверждён не для каждого занятия.","Edge описывает четыре уровня близости. Внимание и совместное время важны; игнорирование контактов может повлиять на связь. Точные пороги, сроки снижения и все награды за близость не объявлены.","Близость может менять развитие истории и проявления привязанности. Конкретные концовки и правила постоянного расставания не проверены. Криминальный профиль каждого героя остаётся отдельной системой."]},"launch":{"name":"Релиз, место и издания","summary":"Подготовьте консоль, проверьте издание и условия открытия бонусов.","sections":[{"title":"Подготовьте консоль","body":"Релиз — 19 ноября 2026 года на PS5 и Xbox Series X|S. Цифровая предзагрузка началась 10 ноября. Rockstar указывает до 212 ГБ в зависимости от устройства: проверьте актуальное требование консоли и оставьте место для обновлений.","image":"assets/hd/photo-39.webp"},{"title":"Выберите издание","body":"Цены в США: Standard — $79,99, Ultimate — $99,99. Отдельное улучшение до Ultimate стоит $20. Оба издания выходят 19 ноября; предзагрузка не открывает раннюю игру.","image":"assets/hd/photo-6.webp"},{"title":"Проверьте комплект","body":"Коробочная Standard содержит код загрузки, а не диск; сверьте регион аккаунта. Ultimate распространяется цифровым образом, а бонусы открываются по ходу глав, не все сразу.","image":"assets/hd/photo-42.webp"},{"title":"Изучите условия бонусов","body":"Подходящие цифровые покупки до 20 ноября включают Vintage Vice City Pack и месяц GTA+. Физические бонусы ограничены наличием. После активации GTA+ продлевается ежемесячно до отмены: проверьте подписку перед получением.","image":"assets/hd/photo-104.webp"}],"sources":[{"name":"Rockstar Support — editions and versions","url":"https://support.rockstargames.com/articles/4QfG4FmZCf5W1gS8jy4UVT/grand-theft-auto-vi-platform-editions-and-versions"},{"name":"Rockstar Support — preload FAQ","url":"https://support.rockstargames.com/articles/7nPqOA2uCbpEQHXx7KVrYd/grand-theft-auto-vi-pre-load-faq"},{"name":"Take-Two — US edition prices","url":"https://www.take2games.com/ir/news/rockstar-games-announces-pre-orders-grand-theft-auto-vi"},{"name":"Xbox US — Ultimate Edition Upgrade","url":"https://www.xbox.com/en-us/games/store/grand-theft-auto-vi-ultimate-edition-upgrade/9PN4LLBR8RCH"},{"name":"Rockstar Support — GTA+ bonus renewal","url":"https://support.rockstargames.com/articles/3SZF8cy8dG7lHsLf38uWK1/redeeming-the-one-month-gta-membership-included-with-your-grand-theft-auto-vi-pre-order"}],"body":["Релиз — 19 ноября 2026 года на PS5 и Xbox Series X|S. Цифровая предзагрузка началась 10 ноября. Rockstar указывает до 212 ГБ в зависимости от устройства: проверьте актуальное требование консоли и оставьте место для обновлений.","Цены в США: Standard — $79,99, Ultimate — $99,99. Отдельное улучшение до Ultimate стоит $20. Оба издания выходят 19 ноября; предзагрузка не открывает раннюю игру.","Коробочная Standard содержит код загрузки, а не диск; сверьте регион аккаунта. Ultimate распространяется цифровым образом, а бонусы открываются по ходу глав, не все сразу.","Подходящие цифровые покупки до 20 ноября включают Vintage Vice City Pack и месяц GTA+. Физические бонусы ограничены наличием. После активации GTA+ продлевается ежемесячно до отмены: проверьте подписку перед получением."]}}};
(()=>{const d=window.VICE_GAMEPLAY_COPY[window.VICE_LOCALE]||window.VICE_GAMEPLAY_COPY.en;for(const[id,g]of Object.entries(d)){const row=window.ATLAS.guides.find(x=>x.id===id);if(row)Object.assign(row,g);}})();
window.VICE_MUSIC_FACTS={"en":["The album and the score","34 original songs · November 19","The companion album brings together a broad artist lineup. The singles below are announced releases, not a complete in-game radio playlist.","Justice · December 11","The separate Original Score album has 30 tracks plus digital bonus tracks. Its adaptive compositions follow the action; guest artists on a single are not automatically co-composers of the whole score."],"es":["El álbum y la banda sonora","34 canciones originales · 19 de noviembre","El álbum reúne a numerosos artistas. Los sencillos de abajo son lanzamientos anunciados, no la lista completa de la radio del juego.","Justice · 11 de diciembre","El álbum independiente de la música original incluye 30 pistas y extras digitales. Sus composiciones se adaptan a la acción; colaborar en un sencillo no equivale a componer toda la banda sonora."],"pt-br":["O álbum e a trilha original","34 músicas originais · 19 de novembro","O álbum reúne diversos artistas. Os singles abaixo são lançamentos anunciados, não a programação completa das rádios do jogo.","Justice · 11 de dezembro","O álbum separado da trilha original traz 30 faixas e bônus digitais. As composições acompanham a ação; participar de um single não significa compor toda a trilha."],"de":["Das Album und der Score","34 neue Songs · 19. November","Das Begleitalbum vereint viele Künstler. Die folgenden Singles sind angekündigte Veröffentlichungen, keine vollständige Radioplaylist des Spiels.","Justice · 11. Dezember","Das separate Original-Score-Album enthält 30 Stücke und digitale Bonustracks. Die adaptive Musik folgt der Handlung; ein Gastauftritt auf einer Single bedeutet nicht die Mitarbeit am gesamten Score."],"fr":["L’album et la musique originale","34 chansons originales · 19 novembre","L’album réunit de nombreux artistes. Les singles ci-dessous sont des sorties annoncées, pas la liste complète des radios du jeu.","Justice · 11 décembre","L’album distinct de musique originale comprend 30 titres et des bonus numériques. Les compositions suivent l’action ; participer à un single ne signifie pas composer toute la musique du jeu."],"it":["L’album e la musica originale","34 brani originali · 19 novembre","L’album riunisce molti artisti. I singoli qui sotto sono uscite annunciate, non la playlist completa delle radio del gioco.","Justice · 11 dicembre","L’album separato della musica originale contiene 30 brani e bonus digitali. Le composizioni seguono l’azione; una partecipazione a un singolo non equivale a comporre l’intera colonna sonora."],"ru":["Альбом и оригинальная музыка","34 оригинальные песни · 19 ноября","В альбоме участвуют разные исполнители. Синглы ниже — анонсированные релизы, а не полный плейлист игрового радио.","Justice · 11 декабря","Отдельный альбом оригинальной музыки содержит 30 композиций и цифровые бонусы. Адаптивная музыка следует за действием; участие в одном сингле не означает авторство всего сопровождения."]};